Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:19.31,中文,,0,0,0,,《时空线索》 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:29.51,中文,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 他们竟然准时\N{\r外文}Can't believe it. They're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:31.95,中文,,0,0,0,,带这些水手去狂欢吧\N{\r外文}Let's get these boys to their party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:54.23,中文,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\r外文}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:27.19,中文,,0,0,0,,今天是肥美周二 10点48分 新奥尔良嘉年华会\N{\r外文}It's 10:48 on Fat Tuesday, Mardi Gras.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我把时间倒转到1964年\N{\r外文}Now let's go back in time to 1964.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.07,0:03:35.75,中文,,0,0,0,,为各位播放海滩男孩的名曲\N{\r外文}The Beach Boys on 105.3 FM, the heart of New Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.34,中文,,0,0,0,,（新奥尔良欢迎尼米兹号全体舰员）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:03.63,中文,,0,0,0,,离远一点 给它点空间\N{\r外文}Okay. Take it out wide. Give the pig some room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:30.33,中文,,0,0,0,,（烟酒枪械管制局公务车）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:56.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我女儿在渡轮上面 拜托\N{\r外文}My daughter's on that ferry. Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:59.47,中文,,0,0,0,,天啊 我的女儿\N{\r外文}Oh, God, my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:06.07,中文,,0,0,0,,要我去查另一边吗\N{\r外文}Do the other side?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:04.67,中文,,0,0,0,,烟酒枪械管制局唐纳利探员\N{\r外文}ATF New Orleans, Agent Donnelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:06.95,中文,,0,0,0,,打给新奥尔良警方\N{\r外文}Listen, call New Orleans PD.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:09.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我要港口的全部监控录像\N{\r外文}I want all surveillance from the Algiers dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:10.83,中文,,0,0,0,,再给城市交通局打电话\N{\r外文}Then call City Transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:13.11,中文,,0,0,0,,也要新月城大桥的监控录像\N{\r外文}I want the Crescent City Bridge surveillance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:14.87,中文,,0,0,0,,10点到11点\N{\r外文}westbound between 10:00 and 11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:15.99,中文,,0,0,0,,好 没问题\N{\r外文}All right, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:59.27,中文,,0,0,0,,烟酒枪械管制局探员呢\N{\r外文}Hey. Seen an ATF agent around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:00.79,中文,,0,0,0,,他到下面去了\N{\r外文}Yeah, he went down below.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:02.91,中文,,0,0,0,,要怎么下去\N{\r外文}How do I get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:04.83,中文,,0,0,0,,从大桥南侧下去\N{\r外文}The south side of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:14.39,中文,,0,0,0,,米努提探员吗\N{\r外文}You Agent Minuti?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.51,中文,,0,0,0,,烟酒枪械管制局米探员\N{\r外文}Larry Minuti, ATF?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:19.39,中文,,0,0,0,,拉里是我搭档 我是道格·柯林\N{\r外文}No, Larry's my partner. I'm Doug Carlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:21.27,中文,,0,0,0,,联邦调查局保罗·卜兹瓦洛探员\N{\r外文}Paul Pryzwarra, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:23.55,中文,,0,0,0,,你好 米探员在哪里\N{\r外文}How you doing? Where's Minuti?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:24.99,中文,,0,0,0,,他在休假\N{\r外文}On vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:28.43,中文,,0,0,0,,不行 这次要全体动员\N{\r外文}Not anymore. We're calling in half the region on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:30.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你能联系到他吗\N{\r外文}You can reach him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:33.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我试过 他不接电话\N{\r外文}I tried. He's not picking up his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:36.51,中文,,0,0,0,,再试一次 事态很严重\N{\r外文}Well, try harder. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:37.91,中文,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\r外文}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:41.15,中文,,0,0,0,,你在找什么\N{\r外文}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:43.19,中文,,0,0,0,,可疑的东西\N{\r外文}Anything that doesn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:48.75,中文,,0,0,0,,扶我一把\N{\r外文}You want to give me a spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:51.11,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.95,中文,,0,0,0,,硝酸铵和燃油\N{\r外文}ANFO.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.03,0:11:07.83,中文,,0,0,0,,硝酸铵具有水溶性\N{\r外文}Ammonium nitrate, water-soluble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:10.71,中文,,0,0,0,,燃油在爆炸后会烧尽\N{\r外文}Fuel oil would have burnt off during the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:12.87,中文,,0,0,0,,如果用的是铵油炸药 经过河水和雨水的冲刷\N{\r外文}Between the river and the rain, if ANFO was used,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:14.15,中文,,0,0,0,,只有一个地方会留下残迹\N{\r外文}the only place you'd find it would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:16.03,中文,,0,0,0,,这座大桥底下\N{\r外文}Underneath this bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:17.95,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:20.83,中文,,0,0,0,,也许是意外\N{\r外文}We can't rule out an accident at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.15,中文,,0,0,0,,不一定是犯罪 我有个主意\N{\r外文}It's not officially a crime scene yet. Here's a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:24.35,中文,,0,0,0,,扩大封锁范围\N{\r外文}Why don't we double the perimeter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:26.27,中文,,0,0,0,,把闲杂人等赶走\N{\r外文}so we don't have wall-to-wall trailers down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:29.75,中文,,0,0,0,,然后寻找物证 盘问目击证人\N{\r外文}Now, we're gonna need all our manpower for evidence control and witness processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:33.51,中文,,0,0,0,,直到确定这是犯罪调查\N{\r外文}Now, we need to keep it tight until we can determine that it is a crime investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.79,中文,,0,0,0,,这是犯罪调查\N{\r外文}It is a crime investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.87,0:11:38.59,中文,,0,0,0,,我找到起爆筒残骸\N{\r外文}Got a piece of electric blasting cap
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:41.71,中文,,0,0,0,,以及一小段铜线\N{\r外文}and a strand of what appears to be leg wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:45.07,中文,,0,0,0,,几百万个这玩意被冲到港口\N{\r外文}About a million of those blue particles washed up on the Algiers side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:47.83,中文,,0,0,0,,可能来自货轮或大琵琶桶\N{\r外文}It's probably from a plastic container or a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.03,中文,,0,0,0,,硝酸铵和燃油\N{\r外文}ANFO?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:52.87,中文,,0,0,0,,很有可能 我在新月市大桥底下找到残迹\N{\r外文}Most likely. There was post-blast residue under the Crescent City Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:57.99,中文,,0,0,0,,铜线绝缘管能查出起爆筒制造商\N{\r外文}The insulation on the leg wire will inform us of who the manufacturer of the blasting cap is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:01.31,中文,,0,0,0,,这样就能找到炸弹的来源\N{\r外文}Then we go after the switching mechanism and the bomb's power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.39,0:12:04.35,中文,,0,0,0,,不用化验也知道\N{\r外文}We probably don't need to wait for the lab to tell us what we already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这是炸弹和引爆器\N{\r外文}that this is an explosive and a trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:08.11,中文,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\r外文}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:10.47,中文,,0,0,0,,烟酒枪械管制局探员道格·柯林\N{\r外文}Oh, I'm sorry. I'm Doug Carlin, ATF.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.19,中文,,0,0,0,,这里谁是老大 我们正在商量\N{\r外文}Who's in charge? We're working on that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:13.39,中文,,0,0,0,,不要争\N{\r外文}Gentlemen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:15.35,中文,,0,0,0,,是我 艾德·奥肯\N{\r外文}Ed Elkins. I'm in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:16.55,中文,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\r外文}Oh, good, good, good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.35,中文,,0,0,0,,你是老大\N{\r外文}You're in charge, then? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我要先知道咖啡在哪里\N{\r外文}First things first. Where's the coffeepot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:21.51,中文,,0,0,0,,艾德\N{\r外文}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:24.47,中文,,0,0,0,,这是警方调查案\N{\r外文}Come on, this is a police investigation, right? Operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.55,0:12:26.23,中文,,0,0,0,,一定要有咖啡\N{\r外文}We gotta have a coffeepot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:28.31,中文,,0,0,0,,咖啡壶在后面\N{\r外文}Yeah, you'll find it in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:29.55,中文,,0,0,0,,后面 是\N{\r外文}Back there? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.43,中文,,0,0,0,,他才是老大 太好了 多谢了\N{\r外文}He is in charge. Thank you, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:46.37,中文,,0,0,0,,（烟酒枪械管制局）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.07,0:12:56.43,中文,,0,0,0,,看到什么吗\N{\r外文}See anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:57.87,中文,,0,0,0,,一大堆车\N{\r外文}Traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:12:59.67,中文,,0,0,0,,倒回去看看\N{\r外文}Hit rewind for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.67,0:13:01.79,中文,,0,0,0,,拉里有没有回电\N{\r外文}Hey, did Larry call?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:03.83,中文,,0,0,0,,没有 我们又留了言\N{\r外文}Still not answering his cell. We left another message.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:05.03,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.27,中文,,0,0,0,,那个女生找到你吗 什么女生\N{\r外文}Say, that girl ever get ahold of you? What girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:09.79,中文,,0,0,0,,她问你是不是又高又黑又帅\N{\r外文}You know, sexy voice, asked if you were tall, dark and handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:10.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我说你只有又高又黑\N{\r外文}I gave her two out of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:12.63,中文,,0,0,0,,不好笑 放带子吧\N{\r外文}Two out of three. That's very good. Hit play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:13.99,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\r外文}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:20.91,中文,,0,0,0,,拉里 我是道格 你怎么样\N{\r外文}Hey, Larry, this is Doug. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:22.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道你在生气\N{\r外文}Listen, I know you're maybe still pissed off at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:24.63,中文,,0,0,0,,不过快赶过来\N{\r外文}but you need to get your behind down here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:25.83,中文,,0,0,0,,道格 怎样\N{\r外文}Doug. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:28.11,中文,,0,0,0,,奥尔良区里德警长在一线\N{\r外文}Doug, Orleans Parish on line one. It's Sheriff Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:30.47,中文,,0,0,0,,打捞到一具尸体 要查出身份\N{\r外文}They pulled a body out of the water, and they want a profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:32.19,中文,,0,0,0,,用不着\N{\r外文}All right, tell him they don't need a profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:35.11,中文,,0,0,0,,把尸体装起来 我再打给他 没问题\N{\r外文}Just tell him to bag it. I'll call him back. Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:38.63,中文,,0,0,0,,糖果包装纸\N{\r外文}Put this on a candy wrapper?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:39.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我只有这玩意\N{\r外文}It's all I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:41.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你在节食吗\N{\r外文}Cutting back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.79,0:13:45.55,中文,,0,0,0,,暂停\N{\r外文}Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:50.75,中文,,0,0,0,,这是道格·柯林探员\N{\r外文}Yeah, this is ATF Agent Doug Carlin returning your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.95,中文,,0,0,0,,手机号码504 555 0130\N{\r外文}My cell number is 504-555-0130.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:55.91,中文,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\r外文}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:13:57.47,中文,,0,0,0,,骑机车的家伙\N{\r外文}Looks like a dude on a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.55,0:13:59.63,中文,,0,0,0,,继续放\N{\r外文}Run it forward a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:02.95,中文,,0,0,0,,暂停\N{\r外文}Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:07.63,中文,,0,0,0,,他在干嘛\N{\r外文}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:10.63,中文,,0,0,0,,撒尿吗\N{\r外文}Going to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:17.31,中文,,0,0,0,,继续放吧\N{\r外文}Run it forward, run it forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:24.15,中文,,0,0,0,,当时是几点 10点47分\N{\r外文}What time does it say? 10:47.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:27.63,中文,,0,0,0,,那是在爆炸之前 就在爆炸之前\N{\r外文}That's before the explosion, isn't it? Right before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:31.83,中文,,0,0,0,,大家听好\N{\r外文}Can I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.07,中文,,0,0,0,,多谢你们赶来\N{\r外文}Thanks very much for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:37.27,中文,,0,0,0,,我是杰克·麦奎迪 这项调查案的指挥探员\N{\r外文}I'm Jack McCready, special agent in charge of this investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.83,0:14:42.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我想先向这场悲剧的死者致哀\N{\r外文}First, let me say our hearts go out to all of those affected by this tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:47.03,中文,,0,0,0,,根据初步估计 死伤人数\N{\r外文}Early estimates place the number of casualties
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:51.07,中文,,0,0,0,,约有543名男女小孩\N{\r外文}at 543 men, women and children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.75,中文,,0,0,0,,新奥尔良最近发生太多悲剧\N{\r外文}Now, Lord knows this city has seen its share of pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.59,中文,,0,0,0,,但是不像卡特里娜飓风\N{\r外文}but unlike Katrina,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:59.59,中文,,0,0,0,,这并不是天灾\N{\r外文}this disaster was not an act of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我们仔细调查过物证\N{\r外文}After careful review of evidence retrieved at the scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.47,0:15:06.95,中文,,0,0,0,,发现这是蓄意的恐怖攻击事件\N{\r外文}we have concluded this was a deliberate act of terrorism,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.47,中文,,0,0,0,,总统也表示同意\N{\r外文}and the President concurs with our assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:13.19,中文,,0,0,0,,请各位耐心等待\N{\r外文}On our end, we have to ask for your patience,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:15.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我们会全力调查\N{\r外文}as the investigation will take time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:18.91,中文,,0,0,0,,犯罪现场很特别也很复杂\N{\r外文}It's a unique and complicated crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:22.55,中文,,0,0,0,,没有托运行李或飞行记录\N{\r外文}There's no baggage checks. There's no flight data recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:24.59,中文,,0,0,0,,造成的死伤惨重\N{\r外文}There are maximum casualties,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:28.35,中文,,0,0,0,,物证多半都沉入混浊的河底\N{\r外文}and most of the evidence is under 100 feet of muddy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:31.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这项调查需要很多时间\N{\r外文}There are no shortcuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:36.31,中文,,0,0,0,,道格呢 他才刚走\N{\r外文}Kevin, where's Doug? You just missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:38.55,中文,,0,0,0,,他的车在那里 他搭电车\N{\r外文}Well, his car's still here. Took the streetcar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:40.83,中文,,0,0,0,,什么 电车 别这样看着我\N{\r外文}What? Streetcar? Hey, don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:43.95,中文,,0,0,0,,他的办案方法 帮助他思考\N{\r外文}It's part of his process. He says it helps him think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:50.63,中文,,0,0,0,,里德警长\N{\r外文}Sheriff Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:54.27,中文,,0,0,0,,你好 这是道格·柯林\N{\r外文}How you doing? It's Doug Carlin returning your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:56.75,中文,,0,0,0,,道格 我知道你很忙\N{\r外文}Hey, Doug. I know you got your hands full right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:59.07,中文,,0,0,0,,没问题 什么状况\N{\r外文}Yeah, that's okay. What do you got for me, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:03.15,中文,,0,0,0,,两个小孩子在港口发现女尸\N{\r外文}Well, a couple of kids found a woman face down in the waters off Algiers Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.39,中文,,0,0,0,,身上有三成的灼伤\N{\r外文}She was burnt over 30% of her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:08.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你会看到很多灼伤尸体\N{\r外文}Right, well, you're gonna see a lot of that over the next few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:11.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我们刚成立紧急指挥中心 请鉴识组把尸体包起来\N{\r外文}We've just set up ECC. Just have Crime Scene bag it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:14.67,中文,,0,0,0,,搞定了 尸体在验尸官那里\N{\r外文}Well, we already done that. The body's at the ME's right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:16.79,中文,,0,0,0,,犯罪调查人员也在那里\N{\r外文}Crime Scene's already been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:18.39,中文,,0,0,0,,他们来了又走了\N{\r外文}Yeah, they've been and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.47,0:16:21.07,中文,,0,0,0,,女尸是几点被冲上岸\N{\r外文}Well, exactly what time did this woman wash up on shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:26.11,中文,,0,0,0,,小孩子上午10点42分报案\N{\r外文}Kid called it in at 10:42 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:28.95,中文,,0,0,0,,你是说11点42分吧\N{\r外文}You mean 11:42, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:32.23,中文,,0,0,0,,不 是10点42分 报案记录在我面前\N{\r外文}No, I mean 10:42. I got the sheet right in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.31,0:16:34.67,中文,,0,0,0,,而且我有戴老花眼镜\N{\r外文}and I got my reading glasses on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:43.03,中文,,0,0,0,,四肢和身体有明显的焦化伤痕\N{\r外文}Immediately evident is the focal charring of the limbs and torso.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:47.19,中文,,0,0,0,,脸 颈部和胸部很完整\N{\r外文}Anterior face, neck and chest are intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:51.63,中文,,0,0,0,,只是泡在水里有一点肿胀\N{\r外文}though swollen from apparent immersion in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:03.55,中文,,0,0,0,,握住她的手 这里\N{\r外文}Hold her hand for me, will you? Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.87,0:17:06.35,中文,,0,0,0,,这样\N{\r外文}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:11.62,中文,,0,0,0,,右手每一根手指 都从中端指骨被切断\N{\r外文}Each digit of the right hand has been severed between the middle and distal phalanges.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:12.65,中文,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\r外文}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:16.67,中文,,0,0,0,,伤痕被很大的力量割伤\N{\r外文}Angle of shearing indicates a single sharp-force trauma,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:19.03,中文,,0,0,0,,也许是爆炸的碎片\N{\r外文}possibly caused by shrapnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:22.59,中文,,0,0,0,,不是 伤痕太整齐了\N{\r外文}No. No, it's too even to be shrapnel trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.87,中文,,0,0,0,,焦化伤痕散发强烈气味\N{\r外文}Posterior charring gives off a strong odour,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:29.91,中文,,0,0,0,,表示她死时浸在燃烧的燃油\N{\r外文}suggesting perimortem immersion in burning fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:32.07,中文,,0,0,0,,柴油\N{\r外文}Diesel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:34.15,中文,,0,0,0,,促燃剂 不知道\N{\r外文}Accelerant, maybe? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:37.79,中文,,0,0,0,,她这么接近炸弹不会被冲到这里\N{\r外文}If she was that close to the bomb, she probably wouldn't be laying here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.91,0:17:40.31,中文,,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\r外文}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:43.11,中文,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\r外文}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:44.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你有紫外线探测器吗\N{\r外文}You got a UV gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:46.55,中文,,0,0,0,,就在你后面的桌上\N{\r外文}Yeah, on the table behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:52.43,中文,,0,0,0,,看到吗 胶带\N{\r外文}You see that? Duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:53.55,中文,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\r外文}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.91,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么会有杂色 你看到了吗\N{\r外文}What's that stippling? You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:59.91,中文,,0,0,0,,胶带会粘着水中物质\N{\r外文}Adhesive probably retained some substance against the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.03,中文,,0,0,0,,是\N{\r外文}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:07.67,中文,,0,0,0,,请说\N{\r外文}Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:09.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我替你查了失踪人口\N{\r外文}I ran down those MPRs for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:12.99,中文,,0,0,0,,今早克莱尔·库切弗被报失踪\N{\r外文}A Claire Kuchever was reported missing this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:16.11,中文,,0,0,0,,她没到机场去接她爸爸\N{\r外文}Supposed to pick up her father from the airport, pulled a no-show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.19,0:18:17.31,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:21.51,中文,,0,0,0,,请你进行全面验尸\N{\r外文}All right, Phil, I want you to do a full autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.11,0:18:24.39,中文,,0,0,0,,查出死亡时间和死因\N{\r外文}Concentrate on time and cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:28.11,中文,,0,0,0,,再进行完整化验\N{\r外文}Full spread of lab tests. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:31.43,中文,,0,0,0,,假装今天没发生渡轮爆炸案\N{\r外文}Just pretend like the ferry explosion never happened today, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.83,中文,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\r外文}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:37.63,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\r外文}Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:44.39,中文,,0,0,0,,她挺漂亮的 是\N{\r外文}She's beautiful, huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:46.03,中文,,0,0,0,,是很漂亮\N{\r外文}Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:20.35,中文,,0,0,0,,你需要她的照片 对吧\N{\r外文}You'll need a photograph for your investigation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:24.79,中文,,0,0,0,,家里有很多可以挑选\N{\r外文}There's plenty in the house. Plenty to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:31.39,中文,,0,0,0,,库先生 我感到很抱歉\N{\r外文}Mr Kuchever, I'm sorry about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:37.71,中文,,0,0,0,,不过我要请你确认她的身份\N{\r外文}but I'm gonna need you to confirm your daughter's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:44.79,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:49.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你能记得令嫒周末做什么\N{\r外文}Now, anything that you can tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:52.83,中文,,0,0,0,,不管是几点\N{\r外文}about your daughter's activities over the weekend,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:55.35,中文,,0,0,0,,都对调查有帮助\N{\r外文}or any time, anything at all, will be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.95,0:19:57.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\r外文}Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.79,0:19:59.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我的班机一早8点\N{\r外文}My flight got in at 8:00 a.m. this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:02.87,中文,,0,0,0,,准时抵达 她没去接机\N{\r外文}and she was supposed to pick me up, but she wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:04.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我以为她睡过头了\N{\r外文}I thought maybe she just overslept,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:08.03,中文,,0,0,0,,于是直接搭出租车到她家\N{\r外文}so I took a cab and I went straight to her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:09.71,中文,,0,0,0,,她和艾伦的车不见了\N{\r外文}Her and Alan's car was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:12.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我以为她终于把它卖掉\N{\r外文}so I thought maybe she'd just finally sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:14.83,中文,,0,0,0,,艾伦是谁 她的未婚夫\N{\r外文}Who's Alan? Her fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:16.47,中文,,0,0,0,,前任未婚夫\N{\r外文}Or ex-fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:19.31,中文,,0,0,0,,几个月前分手\N{\r外文}They broke up a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.43,0:20:21.03,中文,,0,0,0,,艾伦现在人在哪里\N{\r外文}And where is he now, Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:23.43,中文,,0,0,0,,他搬到蒙特利尔\N{\r外文}He moved to Montreal. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:26.99,中文,,0,0,0,,反正他配不上她\N{\r外文}She was too good for him, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:29.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你要的话 我有她的毛衣\N{\r外文}I got a sweater that she left, if you want to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:34.31,中文,,0,0,0,,不用了 我需要她家的钥匙\N{\r外文}No, that's okay. But if you have keys to her house, I would appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:38.03,中文,,0,0,0,,她有一个约会\N{\r外文}Oh, she had a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:41.75,中文,,0,0,0,,昨晚她打电话给我 说她要去见一个人\N{\r外文}Last night on the phone, she told me that she was gonna meet someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:43.07,中文,,0,0,0,,没说是谁\N{\r外文}but she didn't say who.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.13,中文,,0,0,0,,她朋友贝丝安排的\N{\r外文}Her friend Beth set it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:46.67,中文,,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\r外文}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:50.59,中文,,0,0,0,,贝丝·沃尔什 克莱尔偶尔替她带她女儿艾比\N{\r外文}Beth Walsh. Claire baby-sits her daughter, Abbey, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:51.75,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:55.03,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\r外文}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:57.51,中文,,0,0,0,,暂时就先这样\N{\r外文}That's good for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:01.63,中文,,0,0,0,,有人会再跟你联系\N{\r外文}Somebody'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:06.07,中文,,0,0,0,,柯林探员\N{\r外文}Agent Carlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:08.43,中文,,0,0,0,,请叫我道格\N{\r外文}Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:10.55,中文,,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\r外文}I want you to take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:12.83,中文,,0,0,0,,这是\N{\r外文}Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:16.19,中文,,0,0,0,,有空的话请你看看\N{\r外文}Just go through them when you get a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.03,0:21:19.71,中文,,0,0,0,,没有这个必要 有这个必要\N{\r外文}Well, it's really not necessary. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:23.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道这只是公事公办\N{\r外文}See, I know how these things go, Agent Carlin,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:25.95,中文,,0,0,0,,不过我希望你能真的关心她\N{\r外文}and I need her to matter to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.97,0:22:29.12,中文,,0,0,0,,（你可以救她）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:38.00,中文,,0,0,0,,（94年份福特休旅车出售）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:18.84,中文,,0,0,0,,（新留言）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:21.35,中文,,0,0,0,,星期一 午后7时48分\N{\r外文}Monday, 7:48 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.43,0:23:23.19,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我是爸爸\N{\r外文}Hi, Claire. It's Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.27,0:23:26.69,中文,,0,0,0,,我的班机明早7点55分到 别太晚睡觉\N{\r外文}My flight gets in at 7:55 tomorrow morning, so don't stay up too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:27.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我爱你 拜拜\N{\r外文}Love you. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:28.92,中文,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（福特车出售）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:29.93,中文,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（洗碗槽血迹）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:32.03,中文,,0,0,0,,星期二 上午9时44分\N{\r外文}Tuesday, 9:44 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.35,0:23:34.39,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我贝丝 你在吗\N{\r外文}Claire? Hi, it's Beth. Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:35.63,中文,,0,0,0,,抱歉这么早给你打电话\N{\r外文}I'm sorry to call you so early,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.71,0:23:37.47,中文,,0,0,0,,你说回到家会打给我\N{\r外文}but you said you were gonna call me when you got home,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:38.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你没有打来害我很担心\N{\r外文}and when you didn't, I started to get worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.07,0:23:41.15,中文,,0,0,0,,贝丝 你在耍我吗 没有\N{\r外文}Beth, is this a joke? Oh, hey, hey! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.23,0:23:43.15,中文,,0,0,0,,我只是替你担心\N{\r外文}Like I said, I was just worried about you, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.23,0:23:45.43,中文,,0,0,0,,有人在 我不方便讲话 稍后再打给你\N{\r外文}I can't talk right now. Someone's here. I'll call you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:46.83,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\r外文}Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:52.39,中文,,0,0,0,,星期二 上午9时50分\N{\r外文}Tuesday, 9:50 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:24:00.39,中文,,0,0,0,,星期二 上午10时04分\N{\r外文}Tuesday, 10:04 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.11,0:24:05.19,中文,,0,0,0,,是爸爸 我有说7点55分吧\N{\r外文}Claire, it's Dad. I did say 7:55, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.27,0:24:07.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我人在机场等你\N{\r外文}I'm here at the airport, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.51,0:24:10.63,中文,,0,0,0,,你不能来就请贝丝来接我\N{\r外文}If you're not coming, I hope you're sending Beth or someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.75,0:24:12.27,中文,,0,0,0,,打给我\N{\r外文}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.19,0:24:16.87,中文,,0,0,0,,星期二 午后1时18分\N{\r外文}Tuesday, 1:18 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.27,0:24:20.63,中文,,0,0,0,,烟酒枪械管制局探员道格·柯林\N{\r外文}Yeah, this is ATF Agent Doug Carlin returning your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.71,0:24:23.79,中文,,0,0,0,,手机号码504 555 0130\N{\r外文}My cell number is 504-555-0130.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.47,0:24:37.03,中文,,0,0,0,,星期二 午后1时18分\N{\r外文}Tuesday, 1:18 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.95,0:24:41.35,中文,,0,0,0,,烟酒枪械管制局探员道格·柯林\N{\r外文}Yeah, this is ATF Agent Doug Carlin returning your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.43,0:24:44.71,中文,,0,0,0,,手机号码504 555 0130\N{\r外文}My cell number is 504-555-0130.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.47,0:25:02.75,中文,,0,0,0,,爆炸震波从这里把舱壁撞穿\N{\r外文}The blast wave initiated here, hit the bulkhead
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.83,0:25:07.91,中文,,0,0,0,,然后一直扩散到这道舱门\N{\r外文}and propagated fore and aft along the path of least resistance until it hits this access hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.99,0:25:10.11,中文,,0,0,0,,损害最严重的地方\N{\r外文}And that's where it gets really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.19,0:25:11.35,中文,,0,0,0,,震波扩散到\N{\r外文}The blast wave continues
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:13.95,中文,,0,0,0,,机房 炸破油槽\N{\r外文}into the engine room, bursting the fuel tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.03,0:25:16.43,中文,,0,0,0,,这条管道把机房的热气\N{\r外文}This utility shaft here acts like a chimney,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.51,0:25:19.07,中文,,0,0,0,,全都吸了进来\N{\r外文}draws the thermal components into the engine room,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.15,0:25:24.51,中文,,0,0,0,,燃烧燃油蒸气 造成威力更大的第二次爆炸\N{\r外文}which ignites the fuel vapour, causing a secondary explosion of far greater magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.59,0:25:27.99,中文,,0,0,0,,整艘渡轮是一枚\N{\r外文}Essentially, the initial device turns the whole ferry into a bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.07,0:25:29.95,中文,,0,0,0,,被引爆的炸弹\N{\r外文}and detonates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.03,0:25:31.71,中文,,0,0,0,,这是初步的猜测\N{\r外文}And so our early guess
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.79,0:25:35.73,中文,,0,0,0,,装炸弹的车辆是红或褐色休旅车\N{\r外文}is that the bomb vehicle was a minivan or SUV, possibly red or tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.81,0:25:37.23,中文,,0,0,0,,车厂和车款\N{\r外文}Make and model?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.31,0:25:41.55,中文,,0,0,0,,要花几个月才查得出来 找到部份的车牌\N{\r外文}Take weeks, maybe months. I got a partial on the licence plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.55,0:25:44.75,中文,,0,0,0,,完蛋\N{\r外文}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.83,0:25:47.75,中文,,0,0,0,,调查所有登记的休旅车\N{\r外文}Check all the SUVs and minivans that are registered in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.83,0:25:49.39,中文,,0,0,0,,最近才出租 购买\N{\r外文}Anything recently rented or purchased,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.47,0:25:51.95,中文,,0,0,0,,或是和窃案或失踪人口有关\N{\r外文}anything tied to a theft or a missing persons report.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.03,0:25:53.35,中文,,0,0,0,,麦奎迪探员 是的\N{\r外文}Agent McCready? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.43,0:25:55.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我是道格·柯林探员\N{\r外文}Doug Carlin, ATF.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.99,0:25:58.03,中文,,0,0,0,,俄克拉荷马市爆炸案\N{\r外文}Oh, yeah. Oklahoma City.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.11,0:25:59.99,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}Right. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.11,0:26:02.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我刚才去看一名年轻女子的验尸\N{\r外文}This afternoon, I witnessed an autopsy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.19,0:26:04.87,中文,,0,0,0,,她被冲到波兰码头附近\N{\r外文}of a young woman who washed up off the Poland Wharf.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.07,0:26:09.47,中文,,0,0,0,,全身严重灼伤 脸部残留四硝酸异戊四醇\N{\r外文}Heavy fuel burns, traces of PETN on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:12.71,中文,,0,0,0,,国内恐怖份子惯用的炸药成份\N{\r外文}PETN, that's the base explosive used by domestic terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.23,0:26:17.39,中文,,0,0,0,,她的断指看起来似乎是爆炸伤害\N{\r外文}She also lost several fingers in what appeared to be blast damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.83,0:26:18.95,中文,,0,0,0,,似乎\N{\r外文}Appeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.03,0:26:21.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我查过潮汐图和她的陈尸地点\N{\r外文}That's right. I checked the tide tables against the position of the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.03,0:26:24.63,中文,,0,0,0,,她那么早就被冲到那里\N{\r外文}For her to have washed up that early and that far upriver,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:28.19,中文,,0,0,0,,应该是在爆炸两小时之前遇害\N{\r外文}she would've had to have been killed two hours before the ferry exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.27,0:26:29.51,中文,,0,0,0,,之前\N{\r外文}Before?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.43,0:26:33.31,中文,,0,0,0,,她在爆炸之前遇害\N{\r外文}She died before the explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.43,0:26:37.15,中文,,0,0,0,,她在爆炸之前就死亡 名字是克莱尔·库切弗\N{\r外文}She died before the explosion, yeah. Her name is Claire Kuchever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.23,0:26:40.43,中文,,0,0,0,,她在爆炸之前被冲到那里\N{\r外文}She washed up before the explosion and against the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.63,中文,,0,0,0,,你有什么推论 是的\N{\r外文}Do you have a scenario? Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.71,0:26:47.47,中文,,0,0,0,,她在家被绑架 嘴巴被胶带封住\N{\r外文}I believe that somebody abducted her in her home, taped her mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.55,0:26:50.39,中文,,0,0,0,,双手被反绑 活活被烧死\N{\r外文}bound her wrists, burnt her alive, dumped her in the river
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.47,0:26:53.47,中文,,0,0,0,,被丢进河里假装是爆炸受害者\N{\r外文}so she would appear to be just another disaster victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.43,0:26:56.11,中文,,0,0,0,,当时还没发生爆炸\N{\r外文}A disaster that hadn't happened yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.19,0:26:58.79,中文,,0,0,0,,四硝酸异戊四醇显示\N{\r外文}But the PETN tells us
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:27:01.51,中文,,0,0,0,,炸弹客和受害者有直接接触\N{\r外文}that the bomber came in direct contact with the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.63,0:27:03.63,中文,,0,0,0,,逮到她的凶手就能侦破爆炸案\N{\r外文}You solve her case, you solve this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.39,0:27:05.99,中文,,0,0,0,,炸弹客为什么找上她\N{\r外文}Why this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.07,0:27:08.71,中文,,0,0,0,,问得好 她的休旅车不见了\N{\r外文}Good question. Her SUV is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.95,0:27:12.63,中文,,0,0,0,,那是辆红褐色福特休旅车\N{\r外文}It's a tan and red Bronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.71,0:27:16.27,中文,,0,0,0,,很可能被偷来装炸弹\N{\r外文}It could have been stolen to drive the bomb to the ferry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.71,0:27:17.91,中文,,0,0,0,,死者\N{\r外文}Oh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.99,0:27:20.91,中文,,0,0,0,,在爆炸案当天一早\N{\r外文}The victim called the local ATF office
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.99,0:27:23.31,中文,,0,0,0,,打给烟酒枪械管制局\N{\r外文}the morning of the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.11,0:27:25.27,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:28.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我们会去查 好\N{\r外文}We'll look into it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.47,0:27:31.15,中文,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\r外文}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.63,0:27:32.75,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.67,0:27:44.15,中文,,0,0,0,,拉里呢\N{\r外文}Where's Larry?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.51,0:27:46.59,中文,,0,0,0,,什么 那是我搭档拉里·米努提\N{\r外文}What? Larry Minuti, my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.67,0:27:49.07,中文,,0,0,0,,是他的车 他人呢\N{\r外文}That's his car right there. Is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.95,0:27:52.51,中文,,0,0,0,,你说他在休假\N{\r外文}I thought you said he was on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.59,0:27:54.43,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.15,0:27:58.27,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\r外文}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.63,0:28:05.03,中文,,0,0,0,,这些车是从港口停车场拖来的\N{\r外文}Those cars were brought here from the Algiers ferry parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.75,0:28:08.99,中文,,0,0,0,,它们是死者的车子\N{\r外文}They're the vehicles that belonged to the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.55,0:28:25.19,中文,,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\r外文}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.15,0:28:41.59,中文,,0,0,0,,他以前是海军陆战队员\N{\r外文}So he's a former Marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.67,0:28:45.27,中文,,0,0,0,,对 也是土生土长的新奥尔良人\N{\r外文}Yes, sir. Yeah. Local, too. He's born and bred in New Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.11,0:28:47.43,中文,,0,0,0,,他在这里还有家人吗\N{\r外文}His family still in the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.51,0:28:50.15,中文,,0,0,0,,没有 只剩他一个人\N{\r外文}Nope. Nothing, really, but his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.67,0:28:52.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你喜欢他 他很聪明\N{\r外文}You like him? He's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.35,0:28:55.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢他\N{\r外文}Yeah, I like him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.19,0:28:56.75,中文,,0,0,0,,那就去找他吧\N{\r外文}All right. Let's go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.95,0:29:24.47,中文,,0,0,0,,俄克拉荷马市爆炸案\N{\r外文}Oklahoma City.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.95,0:29:29.15,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.11,0:29:35.43,中文,,0,0,0,,你和拉里交情很好吗 是啊\N{\r外文}You and Larry were close? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.23,0:29:40.27,中文,,0,0,0,,好到会让对方受不了\N{\r外文}Yeah, you know, close enough to get on each other's nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.95,0:29:45.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我负责指挥一个全新调查单位\N{\r外文}Doug, I've been put in charge of a newly-formed investigative unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.31,0:29:49.15,中文,,0,0,0,,这是第一个案子 我要你加入\N{\r外文}The ferry disaster is our first case, and I want you on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.23,0:29:50.39,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么找我\N{\r外文}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.87,0:29:53.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我们的时间有限制\N{\r外文}We've got some unique time constraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.79,0:29:57.83,中文,,0,0,0,,我需要只看犯罪现场一眼\N{\r外文}I need someone who can look at a crime scene exactly one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.19,0:30:01.39,中文,,0,0,0,,就知道有什么不对劲 该查什么\N{\r外文}tell us what's missing, tell us what shouldn't be there,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.47,0:30:02.83,中文,,0,0,0,,不该查什么\N{\r外文}tell us what we can ignore
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.91,0:30:05.35,中文,,0,0,0,,最关键的是 他得指出我们要追查的线索\N{\r外文}and, especially, what we need to pursue.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.43,0:30:08.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你也是本地人 对这里很熟\N{\r外文}Also, you're local. You know the people and you know the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.91,0:30:10.79,中文,,0,0,0,,干嘛找ATF探员\N{\r外文}But why an ATF guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:13.39,中文,,0,0,0,,这是你的大好机会\N{\r外文}Why not? It's your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:16.15,中文,,0,0,0,,你想找到你搭档的凶手 对吧\N{\r外文}You want to find the guy who killed Minuti, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.99,0:30:20.07,中文,,0,0,0,,对\N{\r外文}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.31,0:30:45.63,中文,,0,0,0,,你一定有很多问题\N{\r外文}I guess you've got some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.71,0:30:48.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我得先知道这是什么地方\N{\r外文}For me to have questions, first I'd need to know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.63,0:31:19.47,中文,,0,0,0,,现在我有问题了\N{\r外文}Now I do have some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.55,0:31:22.11,中文,,0,0,0,,什么都别碰 我们现在还不需要你插手\N{\r外文}Don't touch anything. We don't need you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.19,0:31:25.03,中文,,0,0,0,,你记得亚力山大·丹尼博士\N{\r外文}Doug, you remember Dr Alexander Denny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.91,0:31:27.35,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么没有声音\N{\r外文}Where's my audio?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.43,0:31:30.11,中文,,0,0,0,,发生声音延迟现象 马上修好\N{\r外文}Compensating for audio delay. Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.55,0:31:33.99,中文,,0,0,0,,正在修正技术人员犯下的技术错误\N{\r外文}Compensating for a technical blunder by a tech guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.11,0:31:37.95,中文,,0,0,0,,画面很清晰 这是4天6时3分45秒\N{\r外文}Solid stream. Minus four days, six hours, three minutes, 45 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.07,0:31:40.31,中文,,0,0,0,,和14.5纳秒之前\N{\r外文}And 14 and a half nanoseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.07,0:31:42.15,中文,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.99,0:31:46.07,中文,,0,0,0,,有问题就问吧\N{\r外文}Anytime you want to jump in here, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.39,0:31:47.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你说我\N{\r外文}Me? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.23,0:31:58.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我们在找什么\N{\r外文}What are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.71,0:32:01.91,中文,,0,0,0,,线索 嫌犯 可疑现象\N{\r外文}You know, clues, suspects, anything out of the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.71,0:32:04.95,中文,,0,0,0,,这是几时拍的 四天半前\N{\r外文}When was this taken? Four and a half days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.03,0:32:07.31,中文,,0,0,0,,放大背包客\N{\r外文}Gunnars, try the guy with the backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.59,0:32:16.31,中文,,0,0,0,,好甜蜜\N{\r外文}Oh, that's tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.39,0:32:18.71,中文,,0,0,0,,真令人羡慕 扩大范围\N{\r外文}I wish I had someone. Okay, widen out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:21.95,中文,,0,0,0,,切换到停车甲板\N{\r外文}Let's cruise the car deck for a while, see what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.83,0:32:30.47,中文,,0,0,0,,四天前的画面怎么能切换角度\N{\r外文}How can you change the angle on footage taken four and a half days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.55,0:32:31.91,中文,,0,0,0,,这是数字重组画面\N{\r外文}This is a digital recreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.99,0:32:35.11,中文,,0,0,0,,把所有资料组成一个片段\N{\r外文}We're combining all the data we've got into one fluid shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.19,0:32:37.63,中文,,0,0,0,,可以看到任何角度\N{\r外文}Any angle, any view within the target area.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.63,0:32:41.71,中文,,0,0,0,,切换到通道\N{\r外文}Okay, let's cruise the breezeway,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.79,0:32:43.95,中文,,0,0,0,,看看有什么\N{\r外文}see what we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:46.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这是叫白雪公主的全新程式\N{\r外文}It's a brand-new programme. It's called Snow White.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.75,0:32:48.99,中文,,0,0,0,,信息来自七个人造卫星\N{\r外文}Our primary data comes from seven orbiting satellites,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.07,0:32:52.67,中文,,0,0,0,,它们就像目击证人\N{\r外文}but at any given time, as many as four are surveilling one area.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.75,0:32:57.15,中文,,0,0,0,,每一个都有不同的角度\N{\r外文}It's like having multiple eyewitnesses, each with their own vantage point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.47,0:32:58.95,中文,,0,0,0,,白雪公主\N{\r外文}Snow White?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.63,0:33:08.15,中文,,0,0,0,,哪个小矮人能解释怎么会有声音\N{\r外文}Well, which one of the seven dwarfs can explain to me how you get the audio?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:15.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\r外文}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.39,0:33:17.95,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么要看四天前的画面\N{\r外文}Why do you gotta look at four days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.03,0:33:20.91,中文,,0,0,0,,何不看爆炸当天的画面\N{\r外文}Why don't you just fast-forward it to the day of the explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.99,0:33:24.87,中文,,0,0,0,,一个片段要花四天半才能合成\N{\r外文}We have to wait. It takes four and a half days to render this single fluid shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.23,0:33:29.99,中文,,0,0,0,,重点是一次只能看一遍\N{\r外文}The only thing that matters is that we have exactly one look at any one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.95,0:33:33.71,中文,,0,0,0,,一次只能看十分钟\N{\r外文}Yeah. We can't go back 10 minutes, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.79,0:33:36.87,中文,,0,0,0,,看不到是否有第二个枪手\N{\r外文}Can't look back and see if there was a second gunman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.95,0:33:41.31,中文,,0,0,0,,或1983年谁买了10件卡其裤\N{\r外文}We can't watch the agent buying 10 pairs of cargo pants in 1983.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.47,0:33:44.39,中文,,0,0,0,,但是可以\N{\r外文}All right? But given enough lead time,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.47,0:33:46.71,中文,,0,0,0,,查看目标范围任何地方\N{\r外文}we can look anywhere within the target area, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.79,0:33:50.71,中文,,0,0,0,,全都是4天6小时前的片段\N{\r外文}It's the when that's always constant. It's always four days and six hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.83,0:33:52.31,中文,,0,0,0,,没有例外了吗\N{\r外文}Always. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.39,0:33:56.67,中文,,0,0,0,,就像是看当下发生的事 一旦过去就过去了\N{\r外文}It's like a single trailing moment of now, in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.91,0:34:02.95,中文,,0,0,0,,如果时间不能往前或倒退\N{\r外文}Okay. So if you can't move forward or backward in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.03,0:34:05.03,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么能把片段快转\N{\r外文}how is it the image keeps speeding up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.11,0:34:08.35,中文,,0,0,0,,并没有快转 只是切换角度\N{\r外文}It's not the image that's moving faster, it's just our shifting point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.47,0:34:09.83,中文,,0,0,0,,时间照常流逝\N{\r外文}The passage of time remains constant,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.84,0:34:13.55,中文,,0,0,0,,只是我们能任意切换角度\N{\r外文}but we can shift our point of view within the data stream as fast as we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.87,0:34:17.47,中文,,0,0,0,,懂吗 懂 不懂\N{\r外文}You understand? Yeah. Yeah. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.55,0:34:18.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\r外文}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.83,0:34:21.07,中文,,0,0,0,,所以在四天之内 其实是三天\N{\r外文}So four days from... Well, actually, three days from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.15,0:34:24.43,中文,,0,0,0,,因为过了午夜 你可以\N{\r外文}since it's after midnight, you'll be able to look back
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.51,0:34:26.27,中文,,0,0,0,,回到发生爆炸当天\N{\r外文}to the day of the explosion, see who did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.35,0:34:28.39,中文,,0,0,0,,查出凶手到底是谁\N{\r外文}how they did it and what they did it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.47,0:34:29.59,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.67,0:34:31.75,中文,,0,0,0,,问题是 你得告诉我们该查哪里\N{\r外文}The only thing is, you need to tell us where to look,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.87,0:34:35.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我们可能会错过重要线索\N{\r外文}'cause, you know, we could miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.83,0:34:37.71,中文,,0,0,0,,再等三天也许太迟了\N{\r外文}Besides, three days could be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.79,0:34:40.43,中文,,0,0,0,,凶手很可能出国再犯案\N{\r外文}He could leave the country, could strike again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.51,0:34:42.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我们得立刻行动\N{\r外文}We need to do whatever we can now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.95,0:34:45.35,中文,,0,0,0,,凶手精心策划这次爆炸案\N{\r外文}We know he's out there planning this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.43,0:34:47.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我们不知道从何查起\N{\r外文}We just don't know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.91,0:34:51.43,中文,,0,0,0,,柯林探员 从哪里开始查\N{\r外文}So, Agent Carlin, where do we look?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.91,0:34:57.83,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔·库切弗的家\N{\r外文}Claire Kuchever's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:34:59.54,中文,,0,0,0,,（橡树路827号）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.23,0:35:02.23,中文,,0,0,0,,看到地址了\N{\r外文}Address is in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.31,0:35:04.79,中文,,0,0,0,,调整信号设置\N{\r外文}All right, match the viewer settings to the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.91,0:35:11.51,中文,,0,0,0,,信号稳定 开始吧\N{\r外文}Signal's solid. All right, dazzle me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.63,0:35:27.79,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\r外文}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.87,0:35:30.27,中文,,0,0,0,,卫星可以穿透墙壁\N{\r外文}You see, with Snow White we can track through walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.11,0:35:33.11,中文,,0,0,0,,通过军方用的红外线影像系统\N{\r外文}It's part of the same infrared thermal-imaging stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.19,0:35:34.35,中文,,0,0,0,,先利用卫星定位\N{\r外文}they're using in Iraq.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.43,0:35:35.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你好 这里是877 504 8423\N{\r外文}Hello. This is 877-504-8423.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.95,0:35:40.35,中文,,0,0,0,,接收热能信号重组影像\N{\r外文}We triangulate from four satellites, pick up the heat signal and reconstruct.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.43,0:35:42.59,中文,,0,0,0,,我们可以穿墙入壁\N{\r外文}Basically, we can walk through walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.71,0:35:46.47,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔·库切弗\N{\r外文}Claire Kuchever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.55,0:35:48.79,中文,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 喂 你认识她\N{\r外文}Claire? Hello? Did you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.31,0:35:52.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我握过她的手 但我不认识她\N{\r外文}We held hands once, but no, I didn't know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.11,0:35:54.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我只想知道你好不好\N{\r外文}Just checking in, wondering how you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.07,0:35:58.19,中文,,0,0,0,,蒙特利尔很赞 我老板很混蛋\N{\r外文}Montreal's fantastic, but my boss is an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.27,0:36:00.47,中文,,0,0,0,,你能切换到她的视线角度吗\N{\r外文}Can you rotate the view, see what she's looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.55,0:36:01.79,中文,,0,0,0,,可以\N{\r外文}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.87,0:36:03.23,中文,,0,0,0,,过来找我\N{\r外文}I want you to come visit, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.31,0:36:05.55,中文,,0,0,0,,这个城市很了不起 你一定会喜欢这里\N{\r外文}The city's phenomenal. You're gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.63,0:36:07.79,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\r外文}Claire? Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.87,0:36:09.71,中文,,0,0,0,,号码 555 0118\N{\r外文}555-0118.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.79,0:36:11.19,中文,,0,0,0,,快抄下来\N{\r外文}Somebody got that? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.27,0:36:12.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\r外文}Claire, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.75,0:36:16.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我考虑了很久 我在想\N{\r外文}Listen, I've had a lot of time to think,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.19,0:36:26.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我要你卖掉休旅车\N{\r外文}and I need you to sell the Bronco as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.07,0:36:35.67,中文,,0,0,0,,一半的钱给我 我很缺钱\N{\r外文}Or at least pay me back my half. I just really need the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:38.19,中文,,0,0,0,,我爱你 打给我\N{\r外文}I love you, honey. Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.67,0:36:40.03,中文,,0,0,0,,太扯了\N{\r外文}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.15,0:36:44.91,中文,,0,0,0,,能跟着她吗 没问题\N{\r外文}Where's she... Can you follow her? No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.99,0:37:04.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我来接\N{\r外文}Yeah, I'm coming, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.19,0:37:07.23,中文,,0,0,0,,哪位\N{\r外文}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.71,0:37:11.59,中文,,0,0,0,,这是施塔尔胡特 我在她家 死者克莱尔的家\N{\r外文}It's Stalhuth, at that house you found. Female murder victim, Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.35,0:37:16.07,中文,,0,0,0,,找到什么\N{\r外文}Right. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.15,0:37:20.35,中文,,0,0,0,,浴室有沾血的棉花棒和纱布\N{\r外文}We got some bloody cotton swabs and gauze strips in the bathroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.35,0:37:21.35,中文,,0,0,0,,洗碗槽有血迹\N{\r外文}some blood in the sink trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.43,0:37:23.11,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 克莱尔\N{\r外文}And, oh, hey, Carlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.19,0:37:26.51,中文,,0,0,0,,柯林 你竟然忘了办案的原则\N{\r外文}Man, when did you completely forget how to investigate a crime scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.59,0:37:27.83,中文,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\r外文}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.91,0:37:29.43,中文,,0,0,0,,这里都是你的指纹\N{\r外文}This place is lousy with your fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.55,0:37:31.19,中文,,0,0,0,,到处都有\N{\r外文}They're all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.75,0:37:41.11,中文,,0,0,0,,帮个忙 告诉我你看到什么 配合下\N{\r外文}Do me a favour. Just describe what you see for me, okay? Just humour me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.79,0:37:45.39,中文,,0,0,0,,女生卧室 化妆镜\N{\r外文}Woman's bedroom. Vanity mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.27,0:37:49.27,中文,,0,0,0,,化妆台有化妆品和保养品\N{\r外文}Dressing table with makeup, knick-knacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:50.51,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\r外文}Okay, okay, okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.59,0:37:53.43,中文,,0,0,0,,有人在吗 有人在刷牙吗\N{\r外文}Is there anybody there? Anybody brushing their teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.51,0:37:58.15,中文,,0,0,0,,只有几名探员 包括亨德里克斯弯着腰\N{\r外文}No. Just a couple agents, including Hendricks, who's bent over,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.23,0:38:01.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我看得到他的股沟\N{\r外文}and I have a fine view of the crack of his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.11,0:38:03.99,中文,,0,0,0,,够了 回头再说\N{\r外文}Okay, I get the picture. Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.35,0:38:05.87,中文,,0,0,0,,满意了吗\N{\r外文}You satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.31,0:38:08.71,中文,,0,0,0,,她遇害之前有个约会\N{\r外文}She was supposed to go on a date the night before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.79,0:38:11.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我要她的记事本 一切有关的记录\N{\r外文}I want to get her appointment books and everything brought down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.71,0:38:15.23,中文,,0,0,0,,信用卡 日记 什么都要\N{\r外文}you know, her phone records, credit cards, diaries, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.31,0:38:17.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我要了解她的一切\N{\r外文}I wanna know everything there is to know about this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.47,0:38:19.59,中文,,0,0,0,,不先看看渡轮吗\N{\r外文}Well, shouldn't we be concentrating on the ferry?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:23.43,中文,,0,0,0,,凶手是会先到渡轮勘查\N{\r外文}Well, yeah, it's likely that our guy cased the ferry first,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:26.19,中文,,0,0,0,,但我们不知道时间\N{\r外文}but we don't know when.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.83,0:38:28.39,中文,,0,0,0,,不知道他的长相\N{\r外文}We don't even know what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.47,0:38:31.55,中文,,0,0,0,,就算看到他也认不出来\N{\r外文}I mean, we could stare him right in the face and not know it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.63,0:38:34.59,中文,,0,0,0,,不过她发生任何事我们都会知道\N{\r外文}But we will notice a change, even a small change, in her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.35,0:38:41.63,中文,,0,0,0,,嗨 贝丝 克莱尔\N{\r外文}Hey, Beth. Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.71,0:38:44.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我提过的家伙想见你\N{\r外文}That guy I've been telling you about really wants to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.47,0:38:46.63,中文,,0,0,0,,跟他约周一晚上\N{\r外文}Okay. Tell him I'll meet him Monday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.75,0:38:47.87,中文,,0,0,0,,周一\N{\r外文}Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.95,0:38:49.39,中文,,0,0,0,,周日呢\N{\r外文}How about Sunday if you're not doing anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.47,0:38:51.15,中文,,0,0,0,,不行 周一 我把你的号码给他\N{\r外文}No, Monday. Great. I'll give him your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.23,0:38:53.27,中文,,0,0,0,,不要 我直接去见他\N{\r外文}No, do not give him my number. I'll go meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.35,0:38:55.03,中文,,0,0,0,,他到底是谁 谁 他是谁\N{\r外文}He's not some psycho killer. Who? Him who?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.11,0:38:58.43,中文,,0,0,0,,等等 我周一好像有事\N{\r外文}I don't even know if I can do it Monday. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.51,0:39:00.03,中文,,0,0,0,,看看她的记事本\N{\r外文}Show me the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.11,0:39:03.23,中文,,0,0,0,,周一没问题\N{\r外文}Monday works.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.31,0:39:04.47,中文,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\r外文}Damn! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.55,0:39:05.67,中文,,0,0,0,,不能倒回去吗\N{\r外文}Can we go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.75,0:39:06.87,中文,,0,0,0,,不能 认真的\N{\r外文}No. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.95,0:39:09.43,中文,,0,0,0,,储存不了这么多数据\N{\r外文}No, it's far too much data for any existing storage system.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.51,0:39:12.39,中文,,0,0,0,,信号不停往前跑 连一秒钟都不能倒退\N{\r外文}It's a constant stream. There's no rewind, no second chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.47,0:39:14.35,中文,,0,0,0,,可以录下来 但是不能倒转\N{\r外文}We can record what we're seeing, but we can't go back
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.43,0:39:15.63,中文,,0,0,0,,没有第二次机会\N{\r外文}and choose to look at something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.71,0:39:17.95,中文,,0,0,0,,可以录下来\N{\r外文}Okay. You said we can record, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.03,0:39:19.19,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}Yes. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.23,0:39:27.31,中文,,0,0,0,,偷看女生洗澡到底能得到什么\N{\r外文}Tell me, is there any scientific or forensic insight likely to be gained
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.87,0:39:30.51,中文,,0,0,0,,科学或医学方面的线索\N{\r外文}by spying on this woman in the shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.59,0:39:33.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我们要确定她很干净\N{\r外文}Shanti, we're trying to make sure the woman's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.91,0:39:39.40,中文,,0,0,0,,你们不如 四处看看浴室\N{\r外文}All right, why don't you, you know, look around the rest of the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.41,0:39:40.47,中文,,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\r外文}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.75,0:39:51.95,中文,,0,0,0,,加斯纳 好\N{\r外文}Gunnars. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.03,0:39:53.19,中文,,0,0,0,,专心一点 抱歉\N{\r外文}You back? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.27,0:39:54.35,中文,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\r外文}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.91,0:39:59.83,中文,,0,0,0,,热敷袋 创可贴 婴儿油\N{\r外文}Icy Hot, Band-Aids, baby oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.95,0:40:01.31,中文,,0,0,0,,她是个乖宝宝\N{\r外文}This woman needs a vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:02.99,中文,,0,0,0,,墙壁另一边是哪里\N{\r外文}What's on the other side of that wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.07,0:40:04.31,中文,,0,0,0,,厨房\N{\r外文}Kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.39,0:40:06.27,中文,,0,0,0,,去看看\N{\r外文}Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.11,0:40:09.99,中文,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\r外文}Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.51,0:40:21.59,中文,,0,0,0,,也许有人在外面 变态佬\N{\r外文}Maybe there's someone out there. Maybe there's a stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.67,0:40:23.11,中文,,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\r外文}Someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.83,0:40:26.39,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 金珍\N{\r外文}Hey, Ginger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.75,0:40:31.91,中文,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\r外文}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.95,0:40:36.27,中文,,0,0,0,,她知道我们在看吗\N{\r外文}Does she know I'm here? Does she know we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.35,0:40:38.71,中文,,0,0,0,,不可能 她看不到我们\N{\r外文}No, impossible. Strictly one-way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.51,0:40:41.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\r外文}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.95,0:40:43.15,中文,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\r外文}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.99,0:40:54.19,中文,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\r外文}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.27,0:40:57.15,中文,,0,0,0,,好吧 看一看附近\N{\r外文}Okay, let's check the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.83,0:41:05.03,中文,,0,0,0,,没有人\N{\r外文}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.43,0:41:09.15,中文,,0,0,0,,谁在偷看她\N{\r外文}Who's watching her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.27,0:41:11.51,中文,,0,0,0,,我们\N{\r外文}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.55,0:41:22.42,中文,,0,0,0,,（我觉得有人在偷看我）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.47,0:41:30.14,中文,,0,0,0,,（好像有人在外面）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.91,0:41:47.27,中文,,0,0,0,,他们还会提出一项追加拨款的请求 用于\N{\r外文}They will also take up a request for more money for the...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.71,0:41:55.07,中文,,0,0,0,,主啊 感谢您赐给我食物和生命\N{\r外文}God, thank you for blessing me with this food and with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.83,0:42:00.35,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道今天会很棒 阿门\N{\r外文}I know today's gonna be a great day. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.11,0:42:08.23,中文,,0,0,0,,你们在唱歌 你们在唱情歌吗\N{\r外文}You guys singing? You singing a love song?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.39,0:42:12.07,中文,,0,0,0,,向对方唱情歌\N{\r外文}You singing a love song to one another?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.07,0:42:14.55,中文,,0,0,0,,你们在干嘛\N{\r外文}What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.47,0:42:38.51,中文,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\r外文}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.59,0:42:49.23,中文,,0,0,0,,是啊 我好久没约会了\N{\r外文}Yeah, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.59,0:43:01.79,中文,,0,0,0,,神做的一切都是永恒\N{\r外文}Everything God has done will remain forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.27,0:43:04.23,中文,,0,0,0,,无所增添\N{\r外文}There is nothing to add to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.31,0:43:06.31,中文,,0,0,0,,无所减少\N{\r外文}nothing to take from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.39,0:43:09.39,中文,,0,0,0,,神这么做是要人\N{\r外文}God has done this so that men should be in awe...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.47,0:43:10.91,中文,,0,0,0,,她的前男友没有去\N{\r外文}Ex didn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.99,0:43:12.11,中文,,0,0,0,,你会去吗\N{\r外文}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.19,0:43:14.27,中文,,0,0,0,,现今的事\N{\r外文}Whatever is has already been,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.39,0:43:16.63,中文,,0,0,0,,早就发生过\N{\r外文}and what will be has been before.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.43,0:43:20.51,中文,,0,0,0,,神让过去的事重新再来\N{\r外文}God calls forth the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.99,0:43:28.75,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔热爱音乐\N{\r外文}Claire loved music.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.47,0:43:31.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我们家附近有座教堂\N{\r外文}There's a church near our house,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.07,0:43:34.47,中文,,0,0,0,,随时都听得到福音歌曲\N{\r外文}and gospel fills the neighbourhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.43,0:43:40.07,中文,,0,0,0,,她小时候看过一场爵士乐葬礼\N{\r外文}When she was little, Claire saw a jazz funeral procession.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.95,0:43:42.75,中文,,0,0,0,,她问我\N{\r外文}She asked me that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.83,0:43:47.55,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么要等到最后才唱歌\N{\r外文}"Why do they always wait until the end to play the good music?"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.97,0:43:54.11,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 这是献给你的音乐 从现在到永远\N{\r外文}Claire, honey, the music's playing for you now and forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.45,0:43:55.24,中文,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（克莱尔·库切弗 1976-2006）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.39,0:44:15.51,中文,,0,0,0,,有四个司机还是五个\N{\r外文}Were there four limo drivers or five?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.59,0:44:18.67,中文,,0,0,0,,四辆礼车 四名司机\N{\r外文}Four limos. Must have been four drivers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.35,0:44:22.79,中文,,0,0,0,,凶手在那里\N{\r外文}He was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.95,0:44:27.57,中文,,0,0,0,,（皇宫餐馆 查特街1801号）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.87,0:44:29.87,中文,,0,0,0,,看到地方了\N{\r外文}Address is in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.51,0:44:32.95,中文,,0,0,0,,皇宫餐馆\N{\r外文}Palace Restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.03,0:44:35.07,中文,,0,0,0,,食物不错\N{\r外文}They got good food there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.83,0:44:41.11,中文,,0,0,0,,抱歉让你们久等\N{\r外文}I'm so sorry for the wait. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.23,0:44:42.35,中文,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\r外文}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.43,0:44:44.23,中文,,0,0,0,,再等一会就有空位\N{\r外文}Your table will be ready in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.31,0:44:45.75,中文,,0,0,0,,饮料免费招待\N{\r外文}Drinks are on me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.83,0:44:47.83,中文,,0,0,0,,请再等一下\N{\r外文}It is gonna be a few more minutes for your table...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.91,0:44:49.67,中文,,0,0,0,,去看45桌吃完甜点了没\N{\r外文}Go upstairs and see if Table 45 is ready for desserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.75,0:44:50.87,中文,,0,0,0,,好吗 好\N{\r外文}All right? I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.99,0:44:53.71,中文,,0,0,0,,等等 喂\N{\r外文}Hold on. Hang on. Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.79,0:44:55.95,中文,,0,0,0,,你要卖休旅车\N{\r外文}Hey, are you the lady with the Bronco for sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.03,0:44:57.43,中文,,0,0,0,,就是他 你怎么知道\N{\r外文}That's him. How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.51,0:44:59.43,中文,,0,0,0,,是他没错 调出通话记录\N{\r外文}That's him. Well, call up the phone list.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.51,0:45:01.55,中文,,0,0,0,,看这号码我们有没有跟踪过\N{\r外文}Let's see if it's a number we've tracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.07,0:45:05.19,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 稍等\N{\r外文}Yes, that's me. Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.27,0:45:06.43,中文,,0,0,0,,帮我招呼一下\N{\r外文}Cover for me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.51,0:45:07.99,中文,,0,0,0,,继续录下去\N{\r外文}Keep that tape running, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.07,0:45:10.83,中文,,0,0,0,,到时候可以进行声音比对\N{\r外文}I'm gonna want a recording of this conversation for voice analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.91,0:45:12.91,中文,,0,0,0,,你听得见吗 你好\N{\r外文}I'm here. Can you hear me? Well, hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.99,0:45:16.59,中文,,0,0,0,,我想先强调我真的很想买车\N{\r外文}Let me tell you, first off, I'm what you could call a real motivated buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.67,0:45:17.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我猜也是\N{\r外文}I bet you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.87,0:45:19.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我急着要买车\N{\r外文}I'm ready to get something right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.43,0:45:21.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我也急着要卖车\N{\r外文}That sounds great. I need to sell something right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.03,0:45:25.27,中文,,0,0,0,,你的价钱和车型正合我意\N{\r外文}Your price looks good, model, mileage...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.63,0:45:27.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我要到哪里看车\N{\r外文}So where can I come by and see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.63,0:45:29.15,中文,,0,0,0,,别告诉他\N{\r外文}Don't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.23,0:45:31.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我住在橡树路827号\N{\r外文}I'm at 827 Kings Oak, in the French Quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.03,0:45:33.83,中文,,0,0,0,,知道在哪儿吗 现在他知道她住在哪里\N{\r外文}Need directions? Now he knows where she lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.95,0:45:36.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我会找得到 明晚方便吗\N{\r外文}No, no, I'll find you. Is tomorrow night good?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.91,0:45:39.71,中文,,0,0,0,,其实不太方便\N{\r外文}Actually, I... Tomorrow night is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.79,0:45:41.19,中文,,0,0,0,,明天 我明天要出门\N{\r外文}Tomorrow? I'm going out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.27,0:45:43.71,中文,,0,0,0,,他会在最后一刻偷车\N{\r外文}He wants to wait for the last possible moment to steal her car,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.79,0:45:45.55,中文,,0,0,0,,让她来不及报案\N{\r外文}then it's too late to report it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.63,0:45:46.87,中文,,0,0,0,,周二如何\N{\r外文}How does Tuesday sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.95,0:45:50.15,中文,,0,0,0,,查到了 504 555 0147\N{\r外文}Got it. 504-555-0147.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.23,0:45:51.63,中文,,0,0,0,,正在追踪\N{\r外文}I see it. Tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.71,0:45:53.59,中文,,0,0,0,,来不及\N{\r外文}I think that's gonna be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.67,0:45:55.51,中文,,0,0,0,,我周二一早就要用车\N{\r外文}See, I need the vehicle Tuesday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.59,0:45:58.23,中文,,0,0,0,,有别人能带我看车吗\N{\r外文}Is there anyone else there that can show me the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.35,0:46:00.03,中文,,0,0,0,,没有 抱歉 他在考虑\N{\r外文}No. Sorry. He's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.11,0:46:01.67,中文,,0,0,0,,有辆开拓者K\N{\r外文}I'll tell you what. There's a K5 Blazer...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.75,0:46:03.55,中文,,0,0,0,,约会代表有人在等她\N{\r外文}A date means somebody's gonna be expecting her
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.63,0:46:05.23,中文,,0,0,0,,她没出现会有问题\N{\r外文}and will miss her if she doesn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.31,0:46:07.51,中文,,0,0,0,,这样计划会泡汤 让我看看这家伙\N{\r外文}That could ruin his plans. Shanti, I want to see this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.59,0:46:11.07,中文,,0,0,0,,没办法 他从电话亭打去 不在范围之内\N{\r外文}No good. It's an outdoor phone booth. Three miles out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.67,0:46:13.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我等你消息\N{\r外文}I hope to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.83,0:46:12.84,中文,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（波本街1985号）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.31,0:46:16.35,中文,,0,0,0,,能戴特殊视镜去吗\N{\r外文}Can we get someone out there with a goggle rig?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.91,0:46:20.91,中文,,0,0,0,,这样就能扩大范围吗\N{\r外文}What's that do? Extend the range?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.99,0:46:22.87,中文,,0,0,0,,那是立即的视觉接触\N{\r外文}Yeah, it's immediate line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.95,0:46:25.55,中文,,0,0,0,,用来搜集范围之外的数据\N{\r外文}But we can use it to gather data outside the target area.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.63,0:46:27.03,中文,,0,0,0,,前提是有数据可收集\N{\r外文}Provided there's any data to gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.11,0:46:28.79,中文,,0,0,0,,这家伙会讲多久电话\N{\r外文}How long is this guy gonna be at the phone booth?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.87,0:46:30.19,中文,,0,0,0,,不久\N{\r外文}Not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.27,0:46:31.87,中文,,0,0,0,,晚安 谢谢\N{\r外文}Have a good night. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.95,0:46:32.99,中文,,0,0,0,,拜了\N{\r外文}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.15,0:46:35.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我做什么都没结果\N{\r外文}Story of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.79,0:46:37.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\r外文}Yeah, story of my life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.47,0:46:39.39,中文,,0,0,0,,听到炸弹客的声音\N{\r外文}All right, now we heard the voice of our bomber,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.47,0:46:41.23,中文,,0,0,0,,去逮他吧\N{\r外文}now we're gonna go after him the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.31,0:46:43.55,中文,,0,0,0,,电话亭附近的监控录像呢\N{\r外文}Can we get video surveillance on that phone booth?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.63,0:46:46.83,中文,,0,0,0,,我们能查任何监控录像\N{\r外文}We can access all surveillance available to any government agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.59,0:46:57.19,中文,,0,0,0,,这是对街的提款机监控画面\N{\r外文}Okay, this is from the ATM camera across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.27,0:47:03.87,中文,,0,0,0,,快转到他打给克莱尔的时间\N{\r外文}All right. Let's fast-forward to the exact time of his phone call to Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.35,0:47:08.91,中文,,0,0,0,,往哪里看\N{\r外文}Where are we supposed to be looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.99,0:47:10.71,中文,,0,0,0,,左边那家伙后面\N{\r外文}Behind the guy on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.71,0:47:13.83,中文,,0,0,0,,能放大吗\N{\r外文}Can you enhance it, Gunnars?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.11,0:47:17.03,中文,,0,0,0,,无法辨别身份\N{\r外文}Not enough for an ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.71,0:47:22.43,中文,,0,0,0,,倒回去 稍微倒点\N{\r外文}Wait, go back. Can you rewind it just a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.51,0:47:24.99,中文,,0,0,0,,暂停 地上是什么\N{\r外文}Stop. What is that on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.99,0:47:29.23,中文,,0,0,0,,装V8的袋子吧\N{\r外文}Looks like a camcorder bag, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.31,0:47:31.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我们有面部识别程序吗 有\N{\r外文}We have facial recognition software? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.11,0:47:33.31,中文,,0,0,0,,用这袋子\N{\r外文}Let's use it on the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.39,0:47:35.79,中文,,0,0,0,,比对爆炸案发生前\N{\r外文}Cross-match it to all the bags on the south side of the city
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.87,0:47:38.71,中文,,0,0,0,,市内售出的每一个袋子\N{\r外文}in the 48 hours leading up to the explosion, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.87,0:47:43.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我们没这么做过\N{\r外文}Don't think it's ever been used this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.63,0:47:45.87,中文,,0,0,0,,这种袋子很普遍\N{\r外文}Yeah, that's kind of a simple image to go for a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.95,0:47:47.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我们没有别的办法\N{\r外文}Well, we got nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.11,0:47:55.07,中文,,0,0,0,,同一个袋子 找到了\N{\r外文}Look, same bag. Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.19,0:48:02.63,中文,,0,0,0,,好 定格\N{\r外文}Okay, freeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.87,0:48:07.51,中文,,0,0,0,,同一个家伙 这是哪里\N{\r外文}Yeah, looks like the same guy, too. Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.59,0:48:09.99,中文,,0,0,0,,渡轮码头的安保摄像头\N{\r外文}Security camera at the Algiers ferry dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.07,0:48:11.51,中文,,0,0,0,,时间呢\N{\r外文}Okay, when is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.59,0:48:14.99,中文,,0,0,0,,爆炸发生前两天 七小时前\N{\r外文}Two nights before the explosion. Seven hours from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.63,0:48:17.91,中文,,0,0,0,,抱歉前两天 七小时前吗\N{\r外文}Two nights before the explosion is seven hours from now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.03,0:48:22.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我们调查的这段时间的七小时前\N{\r外文}Seven hours from now, we will be able to access this point in our time window.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.31,0:48:23.47,中文,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\r外文}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.23,0:48:36.47,中文,,0,0,0,,看着她的生命走向尽头很残忍\N{\r外文}Kind of creepy, seeing that lady's life go down in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.95,0:48:37.99,中文,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\r外文}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.75,0:48:40.79,中文,,0,0,0,,让你更珍惜生命\N{\r外文}Makes you appreciate life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.75,0:48:44.47,中文,,0,0,0,,我建议你回家和老婆或女友亲热\N{\r外文}I suggest you go home and jump on whoever you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.55,0:48:47.19,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 我家里没别人\N{\r外文}That's what I'm gonna do. Nobody home.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.31,0:48:49.35,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\r外文}How'd you let that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.31,0:48:54.99,中文,,0,0,0,,曾经拥有的都会失去 我失去了父母\N{\r外文}Everything you have, you lose, right? Mother, father, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.51,0:48:57.71,中文,,0,0,0,,也失去了帅气外表\N{\r外文}Good looks, Pryzwarra, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.47,0:49:00.27,中文,,0,0,0,,一瞬间失去爱人\N{\r外文}Loved ones gone in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.35,0:49:02.71,中文,,0,0,0,,这就是现实\N{\r外文}That's what this job teaches you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.79,0:49:04.35,中文,,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\r外文}No matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.71,0:49:08.59,中文,,0,0,0,,不管你多努力 还是会失去\N{\r外文}no matter how hard you grab onto something, you still lose it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.67,0:49:12.35,中文,,0,0,0,,再过两小时就能逮到凶手\N{\r外文}Well, we're gonna grab onto this guy in a couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.87,0:49:15.35,中文,,0,0,0,,把这坏蛋绳之以法\N{\r外文}We're gonna nail this son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.35,0:49:18.83,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\r外文}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.67,0:49:24.07,中文,,0,0,0,,不过我们还是救不了她\N{\r外文}No matter what, we still lose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.51,0:49:27.67,中文,,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\r外文}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.67,0:49:32.39,中文,,0,0,0,,世界贸易组织官网提供了 联邦应急管理局网站的链接\N{\r外文}WTO ...dot-com for a link to the FEMA Web site.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.47,0:49:36.05,中文,,0,0,0,,曾作为紧急救援力量的军用直升机 正在撤离该市\N{\r外文}Military helicopters that have served as an emergency force are leaving the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.13,0:49:40.07,中文,,0,0,0,,数十万新奥尔良居民至今无法返乡\N{\r外文}Hundreds of thousands of New Orleans residents have been unable to come back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.15,0:49:40.87,中文,,0,0,0,,整片的社区\N{\r外文}and entire neighbourhoods...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.99,0:49:42.23,中文,,0,0,0,,你和他谈过了\N{\r外文}Did you talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.31,0:49:45.71,中文,,0,0,0,,仍在等待重建 而与此同时 政府机构\N{\r外文}...are still waiting to rebuild. This while governmental agencies...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.39,0:49:47.91,中文,,0,0,0,,噢 糟了 什么事\N{\r外文}Oh, no. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.99,0:49:51.99,中文,,0,0,0,,妈要我替大卫祷告 我忘了\N{\r外文}Mom asked me to say a prayer for David this morning, but I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.07,0:49:54.31,中文,,0,0,0,,她一定会生气\N{\r外文}Okay. Mom is gonna be so mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.39,0:49:57.39,中文,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\r外文}She's not gonna be mad at you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.47,0:49:59.35,中文,,0,0,0,,我们现在就祷告\N{\r外文}We'll just say one now, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.43,0:50:02.39,中文,,0,0,0,,太迟了 永远不会太迟\N{\r外文}It's too late. It's never too late, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.87,0:50:05.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我们祈祷大卫过了美好的一天\N{\r外文}We'll just pray that David had a good day, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.91,0:50:10.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你替大卫祷告 我替我妈祷告\N{\r外文}How about this? You pray for David, and I'll pray for my mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.87,0:50:12.95,中文,,0,0,0,,好 好了\N{\r外文}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.83,0:50:28.95,中文,,0,0,0,,发生什么事 等等\N{\r外文}What's going on? Give it a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.03,0:50:30.63,中文,,0,0,0,,它在重新开机 就快好了\N{\r外文}Gunnars. It's rebooting. It's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.71,0:50:32.55,中文,,0,0,0,,可以了吗 等等\N{\r外文}Are we online? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.63,0:50:33.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我们在线吗 加纳斯\N{\r外文}Are we online? Gunnars!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.87,0:50:35.87,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 我们在线上吗\N{\r外文}What the hell's going on? Shanti, are we back online?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.95,0:50:37.27,中文,,0,0,0,,有东西破坏了力场\N{\r外文}I don't know. Something broached the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.35,0:50:39.83,中文,,0,0,0,,是什么 就是这玩意\N{\r外文}What broached the field? That broached the field, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.91,0:50:42.63,中文,,0,0,0,,这玩意破坏了力场\N{\r外文}That broached the field, right there. That's what broached the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.71,0:50:44.71,中文,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么玩意\N{\r外文}Now, you wanna tell me what the hell this thing is?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.79,0:50:48.19,中文,,0,0,0,,这不是监控影像或热感影像\N{\r外文}It's not surveillance, Paul. It's not electronic thermal imaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.27,0:50:50.91,中文,,0,0,0,,而是回到过去的时光机器 是不是\N{\r外文}You guys have figured out a way to look into the past. Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.99,0:50:52.11,中文,,0,0,0,,不是 你在说谎\N{\r外文}No. You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.19,0:50:54.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道你在说谎 我能说的都说了\N{\r外文}You're lying, and you know it. I've told you everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.71,0:50:57.47,中文,,0,0,0,,她看到了 我对着她照\N{\r外文}She saw it, Paul. I pointed this thing at her just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.55,0:51:00.27,中文,,0,0,0,,她在四天前却能看到\N{\r外文}and she responded to it from four and a half days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.35,0:51:02.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你倒是解释给我听\N{\r外文}Explain that to me. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.91,0:51:04.87,中文,,0,0,0,,拜托解释给我听\N{\r外文}Somebody explain it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.51,0:51:08.07,中文,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\r外文}Hit it, Shanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.15,0:51:13.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我们替国家勘测局进行研发\N{\r外文}For three years, Cambridge has been working for National Reconnaissance on an R & D grant.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.71,0:51:14.87,中文,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.95,0:51:17.35,中文,,0,0,0,,利用爆发能量\N{\r外文}We were attempting to use concentrated bursts of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.43,0:51:19.87,中文,,0,0,0,,加强光学望远镜功效\N{\r外文}to enhance the sensitivity of optical telescopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.95,0:51:21.35,中文,,0,0,0,,在过程中我们实现了突破\N{\r外文}In the process, we had a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.43,0:51:23.91,中文,,0,0,0,,结果那种能量扭曲了时空\N{\r外文}Given enough energy, we could warp the very fabric of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.99,0:51:26.59,中文,,0,0,0,,我说解释 不是说教\N{\r外文}I said explain it to me, not talk science.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.67,0:51:28.31,中文,,0,0,0,,他们有一种方法 好吧 听好\N{\r外文}They found a way to... Look, I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.43,0:51:30.07,中文,,0,0,0,,你们继续说吧\N{\r外文}Why don't you guys just keep talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.15,0:51:33.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我就坐着 我要等你们用白话解释\N{\r外文}I'll just sit here until you figure out what it is you really wanna tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.43,0:51:36.47,中文,,0,0,0,,他们想到办法把时空折回去\N{\r外文}They found a way to fold space back onto itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.35,0:51:42.51,中文,,0,0,0,,好吧 你看 时空就像\N{\r外文}All right, look. We're used to viewing space as flat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.59,0:51:43.71,中文,,0,0,0,,一张平面的白纸\N{\r外文}Like this piece of paper. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.79,0:51:46.11,中文,,0,0,0,,光穿过中间的空间\N{\r外文}To see something from a distance, light has always had to travel
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.19,0:51:47.75,中文,,0,0,0,,才能看到东西\N{\r外文}the long way across the flat space in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.83,0:51:49.27,中文,,0,0,0,,但按照我的解释\N{\r外文}But given what I was trying to explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.35,0:51:52.15,中文,,0,0,0,,当我们折叠时空 让目标接近\N{\r外文}we can fold the space, bring the target closer to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.23,0:51:54.07,中文,,0,0,0,,就创造了爱因斯坦-罗森桥\N{\r外文}create what's known as an Einstein-Rosen bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.15,0:51:57.23,中文,,0,0,0,,或是虫洞 并通过引力场使它悬浮\N{\r外文}otherwise known as a wormhole, suspend it via gravitational field.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.31,0:51:58.55,中文,,0,0,0,,这就是我们看到的 就这样\N{\r外文}That's what we're looking at? That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.63,0:52:00.55,中文,,0,0,0,,另一边是什么\N{\r外文}What's on the other end of the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.67,0:52:02.19,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔的家\N{\r外文}Claire's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.11,0:52:05.23,中文,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\r外文}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.31,0:52:07.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我们折叠时空\N{\r外文}Basically, we're folding space in a higher dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.47,0:52:10.15,中文,,0,0,0,,让不同的时空点瞬间连在一起\N{\r外文}to create an instantaneous link between two distant points.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.23,0:52:11.23,中文,,0,0,0,,瞬间\N{\r外文}Instantaneous?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.23,0:52:13.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我们原本希望是这样 我们希望这样做\N{\r外文}Well, that's what we hoped for and that's what we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.35,0:52:14.59,中文,,0,0,0,,但是电力\N{\r外文}But the electrical force...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.67,0:52:17.23,中文,,0,0,0,,为了搭建这座桥 我们用了很大的能量\N{\r外文}We used huge amounts of energy to create this bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.31,0:52:18.43,中文,,0,0,0,,多大\N{\r外文}All right, how huge?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.51,0:52:20.59,中文,,0,0,0,,记得前一阵子的北美大停电\N{\r外文}You remember that little blackout we had a few years back?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.67,0:52:21.79,中文,,0,0,0,,大家都把错推来推去吗\N{\r外文}Yes, I do. New York blamed Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.87,0:52:23.07,中文,,0,0,0,,对 推来推去\N{\r外文}Right. Canada blamed Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.19,0:52:25.07,中文,,0,0,0,,半个东北地区都停电 原来是你们\N{\r外文}Half the Northeast. You're saying you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.19,0:52:27.23,中文,,0,0,0,,五千万户人家停电 我的错\N{\r外文}Fifty million homes. Right. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.31,0:52:28.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我说要怪就怪加拿大\N{\r外文}Well, I still say we blame Canada, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.07,0:52:31.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我为什么看不到这座桥\N{\r外文}Okay, so why can't I see this bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.51,0:52:33.95,中文,,0,0,0,,尽管存在 但肉眼看不见\N{\r外文}It's not visible to the human eye. I mean, it's real, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.03,0:52:36.75,中文,,0,0,0,,不过跟手机信号或无线电波一样真实\N{\r外文}It's just as real and just as solid as a cell phone signal or a radio wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.87,0:52:39.15,中文,,0,0,0,,我不懂手机原理 不过我会用\N{\r外文}Right. Well, I don't know how a cell phone works.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.23,0:52:42.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我只想知道这玩意要怎么用\N{\r外文}I just know how to use it. So how do we use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.07,0:52:44.51,中文,,0,0,0,,用来看四天半前发生的事\N{\r外文}We can look back four and a half days.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.59,0:52:47.43,中文,,0,0,0,,任何地方 有一定的范围\N{\r外文}And what, we can look anywhere? Limited radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.55,0:52:49.63,中文,,0,0,0,,看到过去\N{\r外文}Right, right, right. Looking into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.71,0:52:51.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我们一直在看着过去\N{\r外文}In a sense, we're always looking in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.83,0:52:54.47,中文,,0,0,0,,当你照镜子\N{\r外文}Even light reflected from yourself in the mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.55,0:52:55.91,中文,,0,0,0,,光需要时间折射\N{\r外文}takes some time to reflect back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.99,0:52:57.11,中文,,0,0,0,,直接点\N{\r外文}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.19,0:53:00.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你是说这座桥的另一边\N{\r外文}You're trying to tell me that on the other side of this bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.43,0:53:03.23,中文,,0,0,0,,是真实的过去 是的\N{\r外文}is the actual past? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.31,0:53:04.71,中文,,0,0,0,,听好\N{\r外文}Wow. Yeah. But look, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.79,0:53:06.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我们发明这玩意纯属意外\N{\r外文}We created this thing by pure accident. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.07,0:53:11.75,中文,,0,0,0,,完全是凑巧才发现时空之窗\N{\r外文}This space and time... This time window is a complete fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.83,0:53:15.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我们很怕乱搞或失去它\N{\r外文}All right? And everybody is terrified of screwing with it for fear of losing it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.75,0:53:17.95,中文,,0,0,0,,或是做出不该做的事\N{\r外文}or suffering the consequences of God knows what,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.03,0:53:20.03,中文,,0,0,0,,所以我们只能追溯过去\N{\r外文}which is why it can only be used as a retroactive tool...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.11,0:53:22.27,中文,,0,0,0,,我想知道她到底是死还是活\N{\r外文}Hey, let me ask you something. Is she alive or is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.35,0:53:23.35,中文,,0,0,0,,你也去了她的葬礼 道格\N{\r外文}You went to her funeral, Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.36,0:53:27.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道 关键是这问题 我不管她是死是活\N{\r外文}I know that, but I think the question still applies. Is she alive or is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.11,0:53:30.83,中文,,0,0,0,,生命就像时空也可以扭曲\N{\r外文}All right. Life, like time and space, is not merely a local phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.91,0:53:32.27,中文,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\r外文}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.55,0:53:35.51,中文,,0,0,0,,这问题有这么难吗\N{\r外文}Am I asking a hard question?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.59,0:53:38.03,中文,,0,0,0,,看来我没解释清楚\N{\r外文}Looks like I picked a bad week to stop snorting hash.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.11,0:53:39.31,中文,,0,0,0,,这样吧 我慢慢说\N{\r外文}All right, I tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.43,0:53:43.99,中文,,0,0,0,,好让你们这些博士听得懂\N{\r外文}I'll speak slow, so those of you with Ph.D.'s in the room can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.07,0:53:46.31,中文,,0,0,0,,瞧 这是显示器 对吧\N{\r外文}It... Here. Look. Here's a monitor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.27,0:53:52.35,中文,,0,0,0,,现在它坏了 它死了\N{\r外文}Now the monitor is broken. It's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.43,0:53:56.27,中文,,0,0,0,,它并没有暂时进入另一个时空\N{\r外文}It is not temporarily transitioned to another state of entropy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.35,0:54:01.55,中文,,0,0,0,,它死了 对吧 她到底死了还是活着\N{\r外文}It's dead, right? Now, is she alive or is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.63,0:54:02.99,中文,,0,0,0,,她还活着 好\N{\r外文}She's alive. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.07,0:54:04.19,中文,,0,0,0,,这就对了嘛\N{\r外文}Now we're getting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.27,0:54:06.23,中文,,0,0,0,,光能回到过去 还有呢\N{\r外文}All right, now, you said light could go back. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.31,0:54:07.91,中文,,0,0,0,,没了 一定有东西能传回去\N{\r外文}Nothing. Something else could be sent back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.99,0:54:10.03,中文,,0,0,0,,人能不能回到过去 人吗\N{\r外文}Come on, Paul. Something. What? A body? A human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.11,0:54:12.19,中文,,0,0,0,,不能 至少活人就会死\N{\r外文}No. Not a person. Not alive, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.27,0:54:14.35,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么 因为你不能违背物理\N{\r外文}Why not? Because you can't beat the physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.43,0:54:15.55,中文,,0,0,0,,因为电磁波\N{\r外文}The electromagnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.63,0:54:18.87,中文,,0,0,0,,当你跨越惠勒界线\N{\r外文}Look, you transition across what's known as the Wheeler Boundary, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.95,0:54:21.19,中文,,0,0,0,,电磁波冲脉会破坏所有电子活动\N{\r外文}An EM pulse annihilates all electrical activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.31,0:54:23.23,中文,,0,0,0,,包括心跳 脑波和一切\N{\r外文}That's your heartbeat, that's brainwaves, that's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.31,0:54:25.23,中文,,0,0,0,,你们做过人体实验\N{\r外文}So what? You haven't tried a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.31,0:54:28.59,中文,,0,0,0,,我们做过实验 知道这是不可能的\N{\r外文}Let's just say that we've done enough tests to know that it's not even possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.67,0:54:31.27,中文,,0,0,0,,理论上来说也不可能 仓鼠回到过去死了\N{\r外文}It's not even theoretically possible. The hamster goes back, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.35,0:54:33.55,中文,,0,0,0,,苍蝇也一样 无线电信号呢\N{\r外文}A drosophila fly, dead. What about a radio signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.63,0:54:34.87,中文,,0,0,0,,可以吗 我们可以发送无线电\N{\r外文}What about that? We could send a radio...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.99,0:54:36.19,中文,,0,0,0,,无线电信号 对\N{\r外文}A radio signal? Yeah, a radio signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.27,0:54:38.11,中文,,0,0,0,,行不通 会受到干扰\N{\r外文}Won't work. Electrical. The field would scramble it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.19,0:54:40.55,中文,,0,0,0,,要不然就用一张纸条 警告的纸条 也不行\N{\r外文}All right, then a note, a warning note. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.63,0:54:42.39,中文,,0,0,0,,一张纸而已 一张纸 不行\N{\r外文}A single piece of paper. One sheet. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.47,0:54:43.91,中文,,0,0,0,,质量不要太大就行 不行\N{\r外文}If we keep the mass low... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.99,0:54:45.11,中文,,0,0,0,,这样可行\N{\r外文}This could work! It could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.19,0:54:46.43,中文,,0,0,0,,当然可以 我们知道凶手会在哪里\N{\r外文}Sure. We know where the guy's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.51,0:54:49.19,中文,,0,0,0,,趁他炸掉渡轮前把他抓起来\N{\r外文}We can apprehend him and put him away before he even blows up the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.27,0:54:51.55,中文,,0,0,0,,该怎么做 发一张纸条给自己\N{\r外文}And how do we do that, exactly? We send it to ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.67,0:54:54.23,中文,,0,0,0,,发给我 对 发到我办公室\N{\r外文}You send it to me. Yeah, send it to me. Send it to my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.31,0:54:56.23,中文,,0,0,0,,发到我四天半前的办公室\N{\r外文}Send it to my office four and a half days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.31,0:54:59.51,中文,,0,0,0,,就算是匿名线报 在他见到克莱尔之前逮到他\N{\r外文}an anonymous tip, and we can capture this guy before he even meets Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.59,0:55:01.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我们知道他要去码头\N{\r外文}We know he's gonna be at the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.51,0:55:02.63,中文,,0,0,0,,无论你做了什么 木已成舟\N{\r外文}Whatever you did, you did it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.71,0:55:05.55,中文,,0,0,0,,送不送纸条都不重要\N{\r外文}Whether you send this note or you don't send this note, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.63,0:55:08.55,中文,,0,0,0,,过去无法改变 物理学上不可能\N{\r外文}You cannot change the past. It's physically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.03,0:55:11.07,中文,,0,0,0,,也许不只和物理有关\N{\r外文}What if there's more than physics?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.11,0:55:15.43,中文,,0,0,0,,和信仰有关\N{\r外文}Okay. Something spiritual, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.51,0:55:18.31,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 好吧\N{\r外文}Yeah, something spiritual. Okay, okay, okay. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.39,0:55:19.87,中文,,0,0,0,,咱们这么想吧\N{\r外文}Just try to think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.95,0:55:21.99,中文,,0,0,0,,上帝已经早有安排\N{\r外文}God's mind is made up about this. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.07,0:55:24.75,中文,,0,0,0,,不管你说是命运或天数也好\N{\r外文}I mean, you know, call it fate, call it destiny, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.83,0:55:28.65,中文,,0,0,0,,事情已经发生 无法改变\N{\r外文}But it already happened, it will keep happening, and it always will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.83,0:55:29.63,中文,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\r外文}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.75,0:55:32.03,中文,,0,0,0,,那就说是命运好了\N{\r外文}And why don't we call it fate, since we're calling it something?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.11,0:55:34.75,中文,,0,0,0,,也许你说的对 我不知道\N{\r外文}Maybe you're right. Maybe you guys are exactly right. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.83,0:55:37.07,中文,,0,0,0,,不过我这一辈子\N{\r外文}All I know is this. For all of my career,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.15,0:55:40.19,中文,,0,0,0,,都在坏人做坏事之后抓他们\N{\r外文}I've been trying to catch people after they do something horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.27,0:55:41.43,中文,,0,0,0,,这次\N{\r外文}For once in my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.51,0:55:44.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我只想及时阻止他们\N{\r外文}I'd like to catch somebody before they do something horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.15,0:55:45.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你们能理解吗\N{\r外文}All right? Can you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.37,0:55:50.92,中文,,0,0,0,,（烟酒枪械管制局）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.23,0:55:52.35,中文,,0,0,0,,看到地方了\N{\r外文}Address is in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.34,0:55:56.46,中文,,0,0,0,,（恐怖份子可能"范"案）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.87,0:56:00.03,中文,,0,0,0,,应该是"犯"案才对\N{\r外文}Two L's. "Surveilling," two L's.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.43,0:56:04.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我们花了纳税者一大堆钱\N{\r外文}Since this is such a tremendous waste of taxpayer money,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.19,0:56:05.63,中文,,0,0,0,,至少要把字写对\N{\r外文}the least we could do is get the spelling right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.71,0:56:06.87,中文,,0,0,0,,未必正确\N{\r外文}That's not necessarily true.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.95,0:56:08.63,中文,,0,0,0,,平行宇宙理论说\N{\r外文}Branching universe theory holds that you can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.75,0:56:10.99,中文,,0,0,0,,平行宇宙理论个头 听着 等下\N{\r外文}Oh, branching universe theory. Look, hold it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.07,0:56:12.99,中文,,0,0,0,,不 我秀给你看\N{\r外文}No, no, no. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.43,0:56:15.31,中文,,0,0,0,,传统的时间概念是一条直线\N{\r外文}The traditional view of time is linear,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.39,0:56:18.35,中文,,0,0,0,,就像河水从过去流到未来\N{\r外文}like a river flowing from the past toward the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.43,0:56:20.51,中文,,0,0,0,,但是你可以改变它的流向\N{\r外文}But you can change the course of a river, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.59,0:56:24.43,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 只要流动发生重大事件\N{\r外文}Exactly. Introduce a significant enough event at any point in this river
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.51,0:56:26.27,中文,,0,0,0,,就能创造另一条支流\N{\r外文}and you create a new branch,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.35,0:56:29.79,中文,,0,0,0,,从不同的方向流向未来\N{\r外文}still flowing toward the future, but along a different route.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.87,0:56:30.99,中文,,0,0,0,,被改变\N{\r外文}Changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.07,0:56:33.23,中文,,0,0,0,,但是时间就像密西西比河\N{\r外文}Yeah, but that river is the Mississippi,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.31,0:56:35.35,中文,,0,0,0,,不管丢多少石头进去\N{\r外文}and we're lobbing what amounts to a pebble into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.43,0:56:38.79,中文,,0,0,0,,都只能溅起一点点水波\N{\r外文}That's a very few tiny ripples in a kind of big body of water, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.87,0:56:40.35,中文,,0,0,0,,这是传统的理论\N{\r外文}Traditionalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.43,0:56:42.07,中文,,0,0,0,,假设创造一条新的时空支流\N{\r外文}Say we do create this new branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.15,0:56:44.35,中文,,0,0,0,,现在的时空会怎样\N{\r外文}What happens to the old one? To this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.43,0:56:45.99,中文,,0,0,0,,去问大科学家吧\N{\r外文}Ask the radical.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.91,0:56:50.23,中文,,0,0,0,,也许它会和新的时空平行前进\N{\r外文}Well, it might continue parallel to the new branch,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.67,0:56:52.79,中文,,0,0,0,,不过最有可能会消失\N{\r外文}but most likely it ceases to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.87,0:56:55.39,中文,,0,0,0,,所以我们都会消失\N{\r外文}The idea is, we cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.47,0:56:58.11,中文,,0,0,0,,这个版本的我们\N{\r外文}All right? This version of us, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.75,0:57:01.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我们没来过这里或见过道格\N{\r外文}You know, we never came here. We didn't meet Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.11,0:57:03.63,中文,,0,0,0,,根本就没这个记忆\N{\r外文}We don't remember it ever happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.71,0:57:06.03,中文,,0,0,0,,光是这一点就值得花一百亿美元\N{\r外文}Well, that's worth 10 billion right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.95,0:57:13.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你自己写还比较快\N{\r外文}Would've been a lot faster if you'd written it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.83,0:57:15.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我认出自己的字迹\N{\r外文}Right. Then I recognise my own handwriting
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.79,0:57:17.75,中文,,0,0,0,,宇宙就会爆炸\N{\r外文}and the universe blows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:30.64,中文,,0,0,0,,（4时44分嫌犯会前往码头）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.73,0:57:32.81,中文,,0,0,0,,（建议加强戒备）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.63,0:57:34.79,中文,,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\r外文}We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.87,0:57:38.19,中文,,0,0,0,,我的办公室在三楼西南角\N{\r外文}All right, third floor, southwest corner. That's where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.83,0:57:41.27,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么会得到这消息\N{\r外文}How'd you get that information?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.35,0:57:42.51,中文,,0,0,0,,我是个好警察\N{\r外文}Good police work.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.59,0:57:43.71,中文,,0,0,0,,那是我 那是我的声音\N{\r外文}That's me. I can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.79,0:57:45.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我不想和你耍手段 我在哪里\N{\r外文}I don't wanna play games with you. Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.31,0:57:46.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我不是在耍手段 你在耍\N{\r外文}I'm not playing games. Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.71,0:57:48.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我没有 你在耍手段\N{\r外文}No, I'm not. There are protocols... Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.51,0:57:50.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我在那里 那是米努提吗\N{\r外文}There I am. Is that Minuti?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.87,0:57:52.79,中文,,0,0,0,,程序不是一纸空文 对 我的搭档拉里\N{\r外文}There's procedures... Yep. That's my partner, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.87,0:57:54.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道这一行是怎么工作\N{\r外文}Look, I know how this job works, you know how this job works.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.07,0:57:56.95,中文,,0,0,0,,天啊 我忘了这部分\N{\r外文}Jesus, I forgot all about this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.03,0:58:00.03,中文,,0,0,0,,找一个适当的地方放纸条\N{\r外文}All right, let's find a nice, happy place to push the note onto.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.11,0:58:01.95,中文,,0,0,0,,你的办公桌 对\N{\r外文}That your desk? Yeah, that's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.07,0:58:03.83,中文,,0,0,0,,移到办公桌\N{\r外文}Okay. Line us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.95,0:58:07.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我凭直觉逮到嫌犯只是尽职\N{\r外文}When I peg a guy on a hunch, that's good police work,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.63,0:58:10.63,中文,,0,0,0,,不是故意要排挤你\N{\r外文}not some conspiracy to keep you out of the loop, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.75,0:58:12.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 道格 继续来\N{\r外文}You know what, Doug? Okay, kid, start pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.07,0:58:14.35,中文,,0,0,0,,用能量波推动纸条\N{\r外文}Expand the wave past the note.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.43,0:58:16.19,中文,,0,0,0,,你有事瞒我 我就保护不了你\N{\r外文}I can't watch your back if you're holding out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.27,0:58:17.39,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\r外文}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.47,0:58:19.47,中文,,0,0,0,,假如我记得没错 最好快点\N{\r外文}If my memory serves me right, we better hurry up,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.55,0:58:21.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我好像就快走了\N{\r外文}'cause I think I'm about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.19,0:58:22.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我需要更多能量 我在加\N{\r外文}I need more cowbell. I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.99,0:58:24.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我不信任你 很好\N{\r外文}Okay, well, I... Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.31,0:58:25.47,中文,,0,0,0,,再等一下\N{\r外文}Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.55,0:58:27.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你俩别说话 加大\N{\r外文}Don't talk to each other. Expand.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.67,0:58:28.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我就快走了\N{\r外文}I'm about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.87,0:58:30.51,中文,,0,0,0,,再找一个搭档 你怎么看\N{\r外文}...another partner? How about that? How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.59,0:58:32.19,中文,,0,0,0,,放轻松 深呼吸\N{\r外文}Everybody relax. Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.27,0:58:33.51,中文,,0,0,0,,加油 我正在努力\N{\r外文}Let's go. I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.59,0:58:35.31,中文,,0,0,0,,准备发出能量波 准备\N{\r外文}Prepare for the final power surge. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.39,0:58:38.63,中文,,0,0,0,,休假愉快 快\N{\r外文}Have a good vacation. All right. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.27,0:58:41.71,中文,,0,0,0,,离开吧\N{\r外文}Walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.11,0:58:53.23,中文,,0,0,0,,发生什么事\N{\r外文}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.31,0:58:54.43,中文,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\r外文}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.51,0:58:56.27,中文,,0,0,0,,不重要 切断电力\N{\r外文}It doesn't matter. Doesn't matter. Pull it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.35,0:58:58.03,中文,,0,0,0,,传送过去了吗 不知道\N{\r外文}Did it go through? I don't know! I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.11,0:58:59.15,中文,,0,0,0,,快切断电力\N{\r外文}Pull it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.39,0:59:09.19,中文,,0,0,0,,在那里 它过去了\N{\r外文}There it is. It went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.27,0:59:10.71,中文,,0,0,0,,好 过去了\N{\r外文}That's right. It's through.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.79,0:59:12.03,中文,,0,0,0,,纸条在那里 太好了\N{\r外文}It went through! Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.11,0:59:13.75,中文,,0,0,0,,不对 等一下\N{\r外文}Whoa, whoa. No, wait a minute. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.83,0:59:15.83,中文,,0,0,0,,并不好 我没回去\N{\r外文}It ain't great yet. I don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.83,0:59:33.59,中文,,0,0,0,,放下来 我不会回去\N{\r外文}Put it down, Larry. I'm not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.40,0:59:36.94,中文,,0,0,0,,（4时44分嫌犯会前往码头）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.02,0:59:38.27,中文,,0,0,0,,（建议加强戒备）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.79,0:59:43.55,中文,,0,0,0,,放下来\N{\r外文}Put it down, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.71,0:59:46.51,中文,,0,0,0,,拉里 别拿走\N{\r外文}Larry, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.83,0:59:49.55,中文,,0,0,0,,跟着他 好\N{\r外文}Follow him. I'm on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.19,1:00:13.23,中文,,0,0,0,,好了 别管米努提\N{\r外文}All right, look, let's... You know what? Let's cut away from Minuti.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.31,1:00:15.79,中文,,0,0,0,,炸弹客走向码头 随时就会到\N{\r外文}The bomber's on his way to the dock. He's due there any minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.87,1:00:18.91,中文,,0,0,0,,等他到了再回去找米努提\N{\r外文}We'll come back to Minuti when he gets there, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.47,1:00:23.91,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.67,1:00:26.35,中文,,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\r外文}Okay, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.23,1:00:32.11,中文,,0,0,0,,能不能绕一圈\N{\r外文}Can we circle it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.19,1:00:38.75,中文,,0,0,0,,应该能看到他了\N{\r外文}We should be able to see him by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.43,1:00:48.35,中文,,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\r外文}That's him. There he is. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.43,1:00:49.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\r外文}Holy shit. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.07,1:00:52.47,中文,,0,0,0,,靠近一点 我要看 就是他\N{\r外文}Move in on him real close. I want to see his... That's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.55,1:00:53.87,中文,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\r外文}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.59,1:00:58.39,中文,,0,0,0,,他在大桥 墓园和自动取款机旁\N{\r外文}That's our guy. That's him. At the bridge, the cemetery, the ATM.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.47,1:00:59.59,中文,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\r外文}That's our guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.71,1:01:01.79,中文,,0,0,0,,识别他的身份\N{\r外文}Shanti, see if you can get an ID, facial ID on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.87,1:01:04.79,中文,,0,0,0,,给我点时间 好 没问题\N{\r外文}Give me some time. Okay. All right. Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.43,1:01:10.59,中文,,0,0,0,,那是你的搭档 我看到了\N{\r外文}There's your partner. I see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.67,1:01:12.15,中文,,0,0,0,,镜头拉近车子\N{\r外文}Try to move in on his truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.23,1:01:13.91,中文,,0,0,0,,查看车牌\N{\r外文}See if we can get a plate.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.83,1:01:16.87,中文,,0,0,0,,没有车牌 回到他身上\N{\r外文}No plate. Get back on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.11,1:01:22.59,中文,,0,0,0,,盯着他\N{\r外文}Stay on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.31,1:01:28.79,中文,,0,0,0,,米努提呢\N{\r外文}Where's Minuti?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.87,1:01:31.23,中文,,0,0,0,,联邦探员 熄掉引擎\N{\r外文}Federal agent! Turn the engine off!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.31,1:01:33.67,中文,,0,0,0,,把引擎熄掉\N{\r外文}Turn the engine off!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.35,1:01:50.19,中文,,0,0,0,,镜头往下\N{\r外文}Tilt back down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.15,1:01:53.99,中文,,0,0,0,,他还在呼吸\N{\r外文}He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.03,1:02:13.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我们能做什么 不知道\N{\r外文}What can we do? I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.87,1:02:18.71,中文,,0,0,0,,他往东行驶 出了范围\N{\r外文}He's travelling east. He's travelling out of range.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.67,1:02:21.05,中文,,0,0,0,,没别的办法吗 什么都行\N{\r外文}Okay, what can we do? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.06,1:02:24.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我不知道 不快点就会把他跟丢\N{\r外文}I don't know, but if we don't do something fast, I'm gonna lose this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.47,1:02:26.15,中文,,0,0,0,,就快要失去信号了\N{\r外文}We're losing the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.23,1:02:27.39,中文,,0,0,0,,一定要加强信号\N{\r外文}We have to boost the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.47,1:02:29.75,中文,,0,0,0,,可以用视镜追踪他\N{\r外文}We need to chase him with the goggle rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.83,1:02:31.47,中文,,0,0,0,,加斯纳在忙\N{\r外文}Yeah, well, Gunnars is a little busy right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.59,1:02:33.79,中文,,0,0,0,,只有他会用\N{\r外文}and he's the only one who can use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.59,1:02:37.23,中文,,0,0,0,,在哪里 视镜\N{\r外文}Where is it? What, the rig? It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.31,1:02:40.15,中文,,0,0,0,,对 在哪里 他的车上\N{\r外文}Yeah, the rig. Where is it? It's in his Hummer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.75,1:02:45.67,中文,,0,0,0,,钥匙也在车上 对\N{\r外文}Keys in there? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.99,1:03:14.03,中文,,0,0,0,,安静 是他\N{\r外文}All right, quiet, everybody. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.63,1:03:16.79,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 他在哪里\N{\r外文}Carlin. Where's he now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.87,1:03:21.23,中文,,0,0,0,,他在向东吗 是\N{\r外文}Is he going east? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.31,1:03:24.07,中文,,0,0,0,,他在东向戴高乐路\N{\r外文}Okay, he's going east, going up on De Gaulle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.15,1:03:27.23,中文,,0,0,0,,试着跟着他 把方向告诉我\N{\r外文}All right, just try to keep him in sight, and keep feeding me directions.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.31,1:03:30.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我会用视镜追踪他\N{\r外文}I'll try and track him with this goggle rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.19,1:03:31.19,中文,,0,0,0,,他办得到吗\N{\r外文}Can he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.27,1:03:34.99,中文,,0,0,0,,当然 只要能追上对方的影像就行\N{\r外文}Yeah, if he can catch up to the image and keep him in sight, that could work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.99,1:03:39.75,中文,,0,0,0,,要怎么打开这玩意\N{\r外文}Hey, how do you turn this thing on?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.87,1:03:42.71,中文,,0,0,0,,后面有开关\N{\r外文}There's an on-off button on the back of the rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.83,1:03:43.85,中文,,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\r外文}Okay, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.86,1:03:44.82,中文,,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\r外文}It's really simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.83,1:03:48.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你只要戴上去 我们就能看到你看到的画面\N{\r外文}Wherever you look, the eyepiece will auto-focus, and we'll see what you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.91,1:03:54.39,中文,,0,0,0,,很好 行了\N{\r外文}Okay, you're live. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.51,1:03:56.99,中文,,0,0,0,,启用视镜 等一下\N{\r外文}Try the goggles. Hang on, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.24,1:04:00.66,中文,,0,0,0,,（超过范围）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.07,1:04:03.51,中文,,0,0,0,,他不见了 超出了范围 什么\N{\r外文}He's gone. Out of range. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.59,1:04:06.27,中文,,0,0,0,,他往哪里去 10号州际公路\N{\r外文}Where's he headed? He's headed toward the I-10.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.35,1:04:07.91,中文,,0,0,0,,东向或西向\N{\r外文}East or west?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.35,1:04:10.67,中文,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\r外文}I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.75,1:04:12.27,中文,,0,0,0,,东向或西向\N{\r外文}East or west?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.35,1:04:14.19,中文,,0,0,0,,我们失去信号\N{\r外文}We lost the signal. We're blind in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.27,1:04:16.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我不知道 等一下\N{\r外文}I don't know. All right, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.51,1:04:21.15,中文,,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\r外文}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.99,1:04:25.67,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\r外文}What? What happened? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.27,1:04:32.91,中文,,0,0,0,,刺激\N{\r外文}This is trippy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.99,1:04:34.11,中文,,0,0,0,,往前看\N{\r外文}Doug, look straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.19,1:04:35.71,中文,,0,0,0,,不然什么都看不到\N{\r外文}We've got the window slaved to your goggles.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.79,1:04:38.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我们看到你四天前看到的东西\N{\r外文}We are seeing what you're seeing four days in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.23,1:04:42.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我们又找到他了\N{\r外文}Okay, I got him. I got him. He's back in range.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.35,1:04:43.79,中文,,0,0,0,,他正往西\N{\r外文}He's going west, not east,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.87,1:04:45.79,中文,,0,0,0,,在新月桥上面\N{\r外文}on the Crescent City Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.55,1:04:50.87,中文,,0,0,0,,他就在那 他在逆向车道\N{\r外文}There he is. That's him. Opposite lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.95,1:04:53.63,中文,,0,0,0,,看到了 这就对了\N{\r外文}I got him. That's him. That's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.71,1:04:55.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我看到他了\N{\r外文}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.31,1:04:58.15,中文,,0,0,0,,小心路上的车\N{\r外文}Watch the traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.35,1:05:09.23,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 他撞到了什么\N{\r外文}What was that? I think he hit something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.59,1:05:16.07,中文,,0,0,0,,跟上去 不然会跟丢他\N{\r外文}Doug, you've gotta stay with him. You're gonna lose him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.51,1:05:18.15,中文,,0,0,0,,发生什么事\N{\r外文}Doug, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.19,1:05:24.99,中文,,0,0,0,,看到他了\N{\r外文}I got him! I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.51,1:05:27.87,中文,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\r外文}All right, all right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.95,1:05:29.87,中文,,0,0,0,,好 跟着他\N{\r外文}Good. Now stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.27,1:05:33.15,中文,,0,0,0,,快打电话叫救护车\N{\r外文}Send paramedics to the Crescent City Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.23,1:05:34.63,中文,,0,0,0,,听到吗\N{\r外文}Got that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.27,1:05:38.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我跟丢他了\N{\r外文}I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.03,1:05:50.35,中文,,0,0,0,,看到他了\N{\r外文}I got him! I got him! All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.43,1:05:51.71,中文,,0,0,0,,是他\N{\r外文}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.79,1:05:53.99,中文,,0,0,0,,他正开向10号州际公路\N{\r外文}He's headed for the 10 to the bayou.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.95,1:06:16.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我看到他 他在正前方\N{\r外文}I can see him. He's right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.67,1:06:26.95,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\r外文}Carlin!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.39,1:06:29.11,中文,,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\r外文}What was that? What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.19,1:06:30.87,中文,,0,0,0,,道格 你没事吧\N{\r外文}Doug, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.23,1:06:35.51,中文,,0,0,0,,道格\N{\r外文}Doug!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.27,1:06:37.39,中文,,0,0,0,,道格\N{\r外文}Doug?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.15,1:06:41.59,中文,,0,0,0,,视镜坏了 什么都看不到\N{\r外文}I think it's broken. I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.67,1:06:44.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我们这还能看到 你还在传送图像\N{\r外文}We still have a signal here. You're still transmitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.95,1:06:47.51,中文,,0,0,0,,你们看得到 我们替你指路\N{\r外文}You can see? We'll talk you through it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.59,1:06:49.63,中文,,0,0,0,,你能开车吗\N{\r外文}Can you still drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.71,1:06:51.11,中文,,0,0,0,,可以 他在哪里\N{\r外文}Yeah, yeah. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.19,1:06:53.59,中文,,0,0,0,,给我们360度视线\N{\r外文}Give us a 360 with the goggle rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.71,1:06:57.39,中文,,0,0,0,,他在那里 转过去\N{\r外文}There! There he is! Pan the thing around.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.47,1:06:59.27,中文,,0,0,0,,那个方向 右边\N{\r外文}Which way? To your right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.35,1:07:00.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你的右边\N{\r外文}To your right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.03,1:07:03.87,中文,,0,0,0,,那 他在那里\N{\r外文}There! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.95,1:07:06.71,中文,,0,0,0,,他要去河湾 那里吗\N{\r外文}He's taking the road to the bayou! Right there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.23,1:07:08.59,中文,,0,0,0,,道路被封锁\N{\r外文}The road is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.67,1:07:10.43,中文,,0,0,0,,开上快速道路 两条线是平行的\N{\r外文}Take the expressway. It parallels the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.51,1:07:11.95,中文,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\r外文}Go. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.55,1:07:26.67,中文,,0,0,0,,看到他吗\N{\r外文}See him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.75,1:07:28.27,中文,,0,0,0,,往右移\N{\r外文}Pan right. Pan right!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.15,1:07:31.03,中文,,0,0,0,,看到他吗\N{\r外文}You still see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.11,1:07:32.71,中文,,0,0,0,,他在大桥的尽头\N{\r外文}He's at the end of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.79,1:07:35.35,中文,,0,0,0,,听到吗 大桥的尽头\N{\r外文}You hear me? He's at the end of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.11,1:07:41.43,中文,,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\r外文}Keep talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.51,1:07:45.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我能说什么 我跟你好亲近\N{\r外文}I don't know what else to tell you. I feel very, very close to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.63,1:07:47.83,中文,,0,0,0,,他在你下方出了交流道\N{\r外文}He took the exit ramp beneath you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.95,1:07:50.83,中文,,0,0,0,,在下一个交流道下去\N{\r外文}Take the next off-ramp. Take the next off-ramp!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.83,1:07:55.43,中文,,0,0,0,,没问题 我下了交流道\N{\r外文}All right, I'm on the off-ramp.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.11,1:07:57.91,中文,,0,0,0,,往右转 然后往反方向开\N{\r外文}Go right, then double back on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.99,1:07:59.71,中文,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\r外文}All right, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.99,1:08:04.27,中文,,0,0,0,,再往右转\N{\r外文}All right, take another right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.67,1:08:11.43,中文,,0,0,0,,还看到他吗\N{\r外文}Still see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.11,1:08:14.67,中文,,0,0,0,,他开向河湾 向左转\N{\r外文}He's heading to the bayou. Take a left here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.51,1:08:22.31,中文,,0,0,0,,很好 很好\N{\r外文}Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.39,1:08:24.03,中文,,0,0,0,,别着急 道格 他就在你前面\N{\r外文}Take it easy, Doug. He's dead ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.11,1:08:25.63,中文,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\r外文}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.55,1:08:35.43,中文,,0,0,0,,他减速了 前面是栅栏 看到了吗\N{\r外文}He's slowing down, coming to a fence. Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.59,1:08:40.15,中文,,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\r外文}Yeah, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.79,1:08:57.11,中文,,0,0,0,,你要是下车 背着背包\N{\r外文}Doug, if you're gonna leave the Hummer, take the backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.23,1:08:59.11,中文,,0,0,0,,里面有视镜的电池\N{\r外文}It's the power source for the rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.87,1:09:28.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你们听得到吗 听得到\N{\r外文}Can you hear me? Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.75,1:09:30.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我们能听到\N{\r外文}Yeah, we can hear you. We can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.99,1:09:32.07,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.99,1:09:43.95,中文,,0,0,0,,他在干嘛\N{\r外文}What's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.23,1:09:49.75,中文,,0,0,0,,他开进建筑物后面\N{\r外文}He's pulled around the back of the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.31,1:09:55.47,中文,,0,0,0,,这里好像发生过爆炸\N{\r外文}Looks like a bomb went off.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.55,1:09:59.23,中文,,0,0,0,,是吗 我们看到建筑物没事\N{\r外文}Really? We see an intact structure here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.03,1:10:03.15,中文,,0,0,0,,没有毁损 没有\N{\r外文}No damage? No, none.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.91,1:10:07.23,中文,,0,0,0,,里面有一辆车\N{\r外文}Looks like a vehicle's inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.31,1:10:09.19,中文,,0,0,0,,是救护车 看到吗\N{\r外文}An ambulance. You see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.15,1:10:12.23,中文,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\r外文}No. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.79,1:10:37.27,中文,,0,0,0,,看到什么吗\N{\r外文}See anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.99,1:10:40.15,中文,,0,0,0,,他在你正前方\N{\r外文}He's dead ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.23,1:10:42.11,中文,,0,0,0,,他把米努提从车上抬下来\N{\r外文}Doug, he's pulling Minuti out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.19,1:10:43.31,中文,,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\r外文}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.39,1:10:45.47,中文,,0,0,0,,往右\N{\r外文}All right, now pan to the right. Pan to the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.55,1:10:46.83,中文,,0,0,0,,往右 看到了\N{\r外文}More right. You got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.91,1:10:48.43,中文,,0,0,0,,他把他从车上拖下来\N{\r外文}Yeah, he's dragging him out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.51,1:10:49.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你们看到他吗\N{\r外文}Do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.91,1:10:52.19,中文,,0,0,0,,看到 就在你前面\N{\r外文}Yeah. Yes. Right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.27,1:10:54.11,中文,,0,0,0,,把声音调大声\N{\r外文}Boost the audio for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.19,1:10:55.75,中文,,0,0,0,,声音调大\N{\r外文}Audio boosted.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.15,1:10:58.67,中文,,0,0,0,,转过去 向后转\N{\r外文}Turn around. Turn around behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.55,1:11:01.51,中文,,0,0,0,,再转到右边\N{\r外文}Larry? Pan back to the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.03,1:11:03.51,中文,,0,0,0,,看到他了 他在哪里\N{\r外文}You've got him now. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.59,1:11:05.67,中文,,0,0,0,,他在拖着拉里\N{\r外文}He's being dragged on the concrete.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.23,1:11:09.59,中文,,0,0,0,,拉里\N{\r外文}Larry!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.19,1:11:15.83,中文,,0,0,0,,什么声音\N{\r外文}What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.67,1:11:18.35,中文,,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\r外文}What's the sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.03,1:11:23.23,中文,,0,0,0,,他在米努提身上倒燃料\N{\r外文}He's pouring some kind of accelerant over Agent Minuti.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.31,1:11:26.59,中文,,0,0,0,,我想是柴油\N{\r外文}I think it's the diesel fuel, like at the ferry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.59,1:11:37.27,中文,,0,0,0,,他醒来了\N{\r外文}He's waking up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.39,1:11:40.63,中文,,0,0,0,,要有心理准备 这是一场谋杀案\N{\r外文}Brace yourselves. I think you're about to witness a murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.91,1:12:55.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我们不让他去他就不会死\N{\r外文}If we hadn't sent him there, he wouldn't be dead now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.07,1:12:58.87,中文,,0,0,0,,他本来就会死 只是死法不同\N{\r外文}No, he was already dead from the ferry. We just changed how he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.95,1:13:00.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我们不能确定\N{\r外文}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.15,1:13:02.67,中文,,0,0,0,,他本可能没事 送了纸条之后他才死\N{\r外文}He could've been standing right next to you, right until we sent that note.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.75,1:13:05.03,中文,,0,0,0,,你得再多创造一个平行宇宙\N{\r外文}You'd need a branching multiple universe for that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.11,1:13:07.91,中文,,0,0,0,,拜托 事情无法改变\N{\r外文}Oh, come on. We can't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.99,1:13:11.35,中文,,0,0,0,,我们不能改变过去 我一直这么认为\N{\r外文}We didn't change anything. That's what I've been trying to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.43,1:13:13.43,中文,,0,0,0,,让我告诉你们吧\N{\r外文}I'll tell you what we did.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.95,1:13:17.35,中文,,0,0,0,,嫌犯开一辆赃车勘查现场\N{\r外文}The suspect used a stolen Blazer to case the dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.43,1:13:21.39,中文,,0,0,0,,他有一辆装满炸弹的车子\N{\r外文}So now he has a truck big enough to drive a bomb onto the ferry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.99,1:13:23.99,中文,,0,0,0,,然后拉里突然出现\N{\r外文}Now Larry shows up, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.55,1:13:27.47,中文,,0,0,0,,他把挡风玻璃射出几个洞\N{\r外文}Larry puts bullet holes through the windshield.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.55,1:13:30.15,中文,,0,0,0,,需要氧气罩吗 不用\N{\r外文}You want a mask? No. No, I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.23,1:13:32.27,中文,,0,0,0,,拉里向他开枪 留下血迹\N{\r外文}Larry puts bullet holes through the windshield,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.35,1:13:36.51,中文,,0,0,0,,所以炸弹客需要另一辆车子\N{\r外文}leaves blood all over the back seat, so now our bomber needs a new truck, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.89,1:13:38.15,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔的车子\N{\r外文}Claire's truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.07,1:13:41.51,中文,,0,0,0,,你饿了吗\N{\r外文}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.59,1:13:42.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我们改变了一件事\N{\r外文}Yeah, we changed one thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.79,1:13:45.55,中文,,0,0,0,,但是却改变不了既定的事实\N{\r外文}but by changing one thing, we didn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.63,1:13:47.31,中文,,0,0,0,,有什么好看的节目\N{\r外文}What's on TV?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.03,1:14:24.11,中文,,0,0,0,,（符合）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.27,1:14:25.51,中文,,0,0,0,,查到了\N{\r外文}Hey, hey, hey, we got a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.99,1:14:27.79,中文,,0,0,0,,卡罗尔·厄尔施塔特 什么\N{\r外文}Carroll Oerstadt. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.87,1:14:30.87,中文,,0,0,0,,他是谁 道格查到的鱼具店老板\N{\r外文}Who is that? Owner of that bait camp Doug found.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.95,1:14:34.03,中文,,0,0,0,,卡车和空气推进艇登记在他名下\N{\r外文}Truck registration, airboat registration, match.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.11,1:14:35.27,中文,,0,0,0,,他拥有另一个不动产\N{\r外文}And another property.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.35,1:14:38.39,中文,,0,0,0,,慕里街5874号 新奥尔良\N{\r外文}5874 Mullie Ave., Ninth Ward, New Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.47,1:14:40.63,中文,,0,0,0,,男的还是女的 男的 走吧\N{\r外文}Is this a he or a she? It's a he. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.83,1:15:16.07,中文,,0,0,0,,安全\N{\r外文}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.34,1:15:27.72,中文,,0,0,0,,（卡罗尔鱼具店）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.15,1:15:46.35,中文,,0,0,0,,试音 1 2 3 4\N{\r外文}Testing, one, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.31,1:15:49.63,中文,,0,0,0,,试音 1 2 3 4\N{\r外文}Testing, one, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.15,1:15:54.99,中文,,0,0,0,,新奥尔良ATF探员 正在审问卡罗尔·厄尔施塔特\N{\r外文}ATF New Orleans, conducting interview with Carroll Oerstadt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.87,1:15:57.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你放弃雇请律师的权利\N{\r外文}You've waived your right to counsel, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.75,1:15:59.51,中文,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\r外文}Yes, sir. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.75,1:16:04.03,中文,,0,0,0,,你精准的策划行动令人佩服\N{\r外文}I'm fascinated with your precision.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.99,1:16:07.83,中文,,0,0,0,,我们很少看到这么高竿的专家\N{\r外文}It's not very often we see that level of expertise around here,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.95,1:16:10.35,中文,,0,0,0,,我想用这段审问过程\N{\r外文}and if it's all right with you, I'd like to use this interview
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.43,1:16:14.19,中文,,0,0,0,,当我们的执法教材\N{\r外文}to educate my colleagues in law enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.27,1:16:16.95,中文,,0,0,0,,没问题 很好 很好\N{\r外文}Yes, sir. Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.03,1:16:18.39,中文,,0,0,0,,先谈谈动机吧\N{\r外文}Let's talk about motive.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.47,1:16:22.19,中文,,0,0,0,,你为什么用炸弹对付美国海军\N{\r外文}Why would you use explosives against the US Navy?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.43,1:16:27.79,中文,,0,0,0,,更正 是美国政府 美国政府\N{\r外文}Correction, sir. US Government. US Government.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.59,1:16:31.95,中文,,0,0,0,,你曾经想加入海军陆战队\N{\r外文}It says here that you tried to enlist in the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.03,1:16:33.91,中文,,0,0,0,,但是遭到拒绝 然后你想加入陆军\N{\r外文}You were rejected. You tried to enlist in the Army,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.99,1:16:36.03,中文,,0,0,0,,也被拒绝\N{\r外文}you were rejected again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.11,1:16:38.39,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\r外文}Why do you think they did that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.87,1:16:42.27,中文,,0,0,0,,因为他们不要爱国者\N{\r外文}Because they don't want patriots.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.91,1:16:46.03,中文,,0,0,0,,军方不再肯定爱国的决心\N{\r外文}The military no longer recognises commitment and purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.55,1:16:50.55,中文,,0,0,0,,他们觉得我太极端 心理状况不稳定\N{\r外文}They thought I was overcommitted and psychologically unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.43,1:16:53.55,中文,,0,0,0,,他们不解我的决心\N{\r外文}They didn't want to understand my value.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.63,1:16:55.47,中文,,0,0,0,,他们现在了解了\N{\r外文}They understand it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.07,1:16:58.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我相信是的 没错\N{\r外文}I believe so. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.71,1:17:04.11,中文,,0,0,0,,你是烟酒枪械管制局探员 没错\N{\r外文}You're ATF, right? Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.95,1:17:07.47,中文,,0,0,0,,有烟吗 你要我可以给你\N{\r外文}Got a smoke? No, I don't. But I can get you one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.59,1:17:09.07,中文,,0,0,0,,你要吗 好的\N{\r外文}Would you like one? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.15,1:17:11.95,中文,,0,0,0,,你想说什么就对着麦克风说\N{\r外文}Okay. Anything you want to say, just talk into the mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.03,1:17:15.31,中文,,0,0,0,,人总是需要更多烟酒和枪械\N{\r外文}A man can always use more alcohol, tobacco and firearms.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.39,1:17:17.39,中文,,0,0,0,,还有其它的东西\N{\r外文}I can think of one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.07,1:17:23.27,中文,,0,0,0,,这就像美国独立战争\N{\r外文}It's like the Revolutionary War, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.35,1:17:26.43,中文,,0,0,0,,爱国者被当成恐怖份子\N{\r外文}"One man's terrorist is another man's patriot," isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.15,1:17:29.27,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 很正确\N{\r外文}Yeah? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.35,1:17:30.91,中文,,0,0,0,,你很了解\N{\r外文}Yeah. You get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.03,1:17:36.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我并不是为了报仇 那是为了什么\N{\r外文}This wasn't about revenge. What was it about?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.11,1:17:40.51,中文,,0,0,0,,使命\N{\r外文}Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.59,1:17:41.87,中文,,0,0,0,,使命\N{\r外文}Destiny?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.11,1:17:44.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你问我的动机\N{\r外文}You've been asking me about my motives.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.91,1:17:46.51,中文,,0,0,0,,还有方法\N{\r外文}Right. Right. My methods.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.51,1:17:47.69,中文,,0,0,0,,（勇气 荣誉）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.95,1:17:49.47,中文,,0,0,0,,这都有关联\N{\r外文}They're all connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.11,1:17:51.67,中文,,0,0,0,,一切都有关联\N{\r外文}Everything's connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.75,1:17:54.03,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔和你有什么关联\N{\r外文}Okay. How was Claire Kuchever connected?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.11,1:17:55.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我需要一辆车\N{\r外文}I needed a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.71,1:17:56.51,中文,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\r外文}And that's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.59,1:17:59.35,中文,,0,0,0,,不全是 我需要追查不到我的车\N{\r外文}No, well, something that couldn't be traced back to me. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.43,1:18:02.19,中文,,0,0,0,,我本来有一辆 那条子坏了事\N{\r外文}I had one ready till that cop showed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.79,1:18:05.51,中文,,0,0,0,,那条子是联邦探员\N{\r外文}That cop was a federal agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.59,1:18:07.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我的搭档拉里 你射杀了他\N{\r外文}Lawrence Minuti. My partner. You shot him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.03,1:18:10.99,中文,,0,0,0,,万一他醒来 我打算烧死他\N{\r外文}He... I was about to burn him and he was waking up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.11,1:18:12.67,中文,,0,0,0,,不过我没有那么残忍\N{\r外文}I mean, I'm not cruel.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.15,1:18:19.47,中文,,0,0,0,,你为什么不烧死克莱尔\N{\r外文}Well, why didn't you "do that" for Claire Kuchever?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.99,1:18:26.51,中文,,0,0,0,,因为她会成为渡轮的牺牲者\N{\r外文}Well, because I needed her to look like a ferry victim,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.59,1:18:29.03,中文,,0,0,0,,不能用枪射杀她\N{\r外文}and a bullet would've given it away. I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.11,1:18:32.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我假装要买车到她家绑架她\N{\r外文}I went to her house on the pretence of buying her car.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.55,1:18:35.71,中文,,0,0,0,,封住她的嘴 罩住她的头\N{\r外文}I took her from behind, taped her mouth and threw a hood over her head.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.79,1:18:36.91,中文,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\r外文}Then?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.99,1:18:39.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我把她绑起来开到我家\N{\r外文}I bound her wrists and her ankles and I drove her back to my place.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.07,1:18:41.91,中文,,0,0,0,,把炸弹放在她车上\N{\r外文}I loaded the device into her car
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.99,1:18:43.55,中文,,0,0,0,,在她身上浇汽油\N{\r外文}and then I soaked her with the gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.63,1:18:44.75,中文,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\r外文}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.83,1:18:45.99,中文,,0,0,0,,后来呢\N{\r外文}And?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.11,1:18:47.55,中文,,0,0,0,,后来的事你都知道\N{\r外文}I think you know what happened after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.63,1:18:49.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我不知道 告诉我\N{\r外文}No, I don't know. I want you to tell me. You gotta talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.63,1:18:51.71,中文,,0,0,0,,大英雄 后来呢\N{\r外文}I mean, you know, come on, hero. What happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.79,1:18:52.99,中文,,0,0,0,,让我告诉你吧\N{\r外文}I'll tell you what happened after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.07,1:18:56.47,中文,,0,0,0,,你夺走543条人命 有何感想\N{\r外文}You killed 543 people. How do you feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.55,1:19:05.23,中文,,0,0,0,,你打一开始就是杀人凶手\N{\r外文}I think that you were a murderer right from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.71,1:19:11.35,中文,,0,0,0,,有时候为了自由要牺牲人命\N{\r外文}Sometimes a little human collateral is the cost of freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.43,1:19:13.31,中文,,0,0,0,,对我来说 他们是牺牲者\N{\r外文}To me, those people were war casualties,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.39,1:19:15.31,中文,,0,0,0,,对你来说 他们是证人\N{\r外文}but to you, they're just evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.39,1:19:17.83,中文,,0,0,0,,这些证词就足够定他的罪\N{\r外文}That'll do. We got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.91,1:19:19.03,中文,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\r外文}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.11,1:19:22.91,中文,,0,0,0,,你自以为很了解 才怪\N{\r外文}You think you know what's coming? You don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.99,1:19:24.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道你要去哪里\N{\r外文}I know where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.35,1:19:29.07,中文,,0,0,0,,而且要去很久\N{\r外文}I know you're gonna be away for a long time. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.99,1:19:32.55,中文,,0,0,0,,这案子不会开庭 是吗\N{\r外文}This case will never even go to trial. No?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.07,1:19:37.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我看到会发生什么事 什么事\N{\r外文}'Cause I seen what's coming. Did... Have you? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.87,1:19:41.11,中文,,0,0,0,,杯子有什么 你能未卜先知\N{\r外文}What is in this glass? You've seen what's coming, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.19,1:19:43.23,中文,,0,0,0,,会发生什么事 告诉我\N{\r外文}Okay, what's coming? You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.19,1:19:48.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我说过 我被赋予一个使命 一种追求\N{\r外文}I told you earlier I have a destiny, a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.99,1:19:52.11,中文,,0,0,0,,撒旦像人类 上帝才是永恒\N{\r外文}Satan reasons like man, but God thinks of eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.67,1:19:57.27,中文,,0,0,0,,世上每一个人都会下地狱\N{\r外文}Well, I prostrate myself before a world that's going to hell in a handbag,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.39,1:20:00.47,中文,,0,0,0,,而我会像上帝一样永垂不朽\N{\r外文}'cause in all eternity, I am here and I will be remembered.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.55,1:20:02.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我有使命\N{\r外文}That's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.79,1:20:04.59,中文,,0,0,0,,炸弹也有使命\N{\r外文}A bomb has a destiny,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.07,1:20:08.27,中文,,0,0,0,,这是造物主安排的命运\N{\r外文}a predetermined fate set by the hand of its creator.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.35,1:20:11.63,中文,,0,0,0,,想要改变命运就会被消灭\N{\r外文}And anyone who tries to alter that destiny will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.71,1:20:15.15,中文,,0,0,0,,想要阻止它发生会适得其反\N{\r外文}Anyone who tries to stop it from happening will cause it to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.23,1:20:17.15,中文,,0,0,0,,你完全搞不清楚\N{\r外文}And that's what you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.23,1:20:21.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我不想和你争论 我只想赢\N{\r外文}We're not here to coexist. I'm here to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.35,1:20:24.23,中文,,0,0,0,,你最好祈祷上帝会帮忙\N{\r外文}So you'd better have some divine intervention, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.99,1:20:27.35,中文,,0,0,0,,你会需要的\N{\r外文}You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.43,1:20:30.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你坐牢最好带润滑油 你会需要的\N{\r外文}You'd better have some K-Y. You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.87,1:20:44.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办\N{\r外文}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.31,1:20:48.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你的任务结束了 什么\N{\r外文}We're shutting you down. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.15,1:20:50.27,中文,,0,0,0,,想要的都有了\N{\r外文}Yeah, we got what we need.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.35,1:20:52.83,中文,,0,0,0,,我们有物证 嫌犯和供词 结束了\N{\r外文}The forensics, the suspect, a confession. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.91,1:20:56.43,中文,,0,0,0,,也许应该继续调查犯罪行为\N{\r外文}Sir, perhaps we should continue and watch the actual crime.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.51,1:20:58.11,中文,,0,0,0,,渡轮爆炸案 他说的对\N{\r外文}The ferry bombing. Right. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.19,1:21:00.31,中文,,0,0,0,,光有供词没有用\N{\r外文}I mean, we can't just go on the confession alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.39,1:21:02.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我们要着眼整个案件 需要更多证据\N{\r外文}We need an airtight case. We need to collect more evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.71,1:21:05.03,中文,,0,0,0,,搜集证据很好 卡林探员\N{\r外文}Well, collecting evidence would've been fine, Agent Carly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.11,1:21:07.71,中文,,0,0,0,,不过你做得太过份\N{\r外文}You took it a little further than that. Agent Carlin. Carlin.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.79,1:21:08.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我姓卡林 不是卡利\N{\r外文}My name is Carlin, not Carly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.99,1:21:11.55,中文,,0,0,0,,办案有一定的程序\N{\r外文}We had protocols in place. There's strict protocols.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.63,1:21:14.35,中文,,0,0,0,,你违反程序 害死一名探员\N{\r外文}And then you had to push it, and now an agent's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.43,1:21:16.75,中文,,0,0,0,,理论上他早就死了\N{\r外文}Sir, by one theory, that already happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.83,1:21:20.07,中文,,0,0,0,,够了 打包走人吧 调查下一个案子\N{\r外文}We're done. Power it down. Pack it up. On to the next case.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.75,1:21:22.59,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔呢\N{\r外文}What about Claire? What...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.07,1:21:25.15,中文,,0,0,0,,告他杀害克莱尔\N{\r外文}Lookit, charging Oerstadt in the Kuchever murder
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.23,1:21:27.87,中文,,0,0,0,,会让人怀疑我们搜证的方法\N{\r外文}is gonna raise too many questions about how we obtained the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.95,1:21:29.35,中文,,0,0,0,,我明白 那克莱尔怎么办\N{\r外文}I understand that, sir, but what about Claire?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.43,1:21:30.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我们就不管这起谋杀案\N{\r外文}Are we just gonna drop the case?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.63,1:21:33.07,中文,,0,0,0,,他会以爆炸案和谋杀探员被起诉\N{\r外文}We got him on the ferry bombing, we got him on killing a federal agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.19,1:21:35.47,中文,,0,0,0,,那已经足够给他打一针 我无法接受这种做法\N{\r外文}That's enough to get him the needle. I cannot accept that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.55,1:21:38.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我懒得理你\N{\r外文}Well, you know, I don't give a rat's ass what you can accept.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.15,1:21:40.75,中文,,0,0,0,,她不重要 他会杀死她\N{\r外文}She doesn't matter. He's gonna kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.83,1:21:44.43,中文,,0,0,0,,再过12小时 他四天前就杀死她\N{\r外文}In 12 hours, he's gonna kill her. He killed her four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.51,1:21:47.15,中文,,0,0,0,,你也参加葬礼 你有病吗\N{\r外文}You were at the funeral. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.07,1:21:52.67,中文,,0,0,0,,没办法了\N{\r外文}It had to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.79,1:21:56.11,中文,,0,0,0,,逮到那家伙我才交出报告\N{\r外文}I delayed turning in my report till we caught the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.79,1:21:58.51,中文,,0,0,0,,反正完成任务了\N{\r外文}Hey, mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.95,1:22:01.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我们赢了 道格\N{\r外文}This is a victory, Doug.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.11,1:22:11.27,中文,,0,0,0,,这是圆满的结局\N{\r外文}Hey. Now, my job is closure.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.35,1:22:13.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你做得很好\N{\r外文}Your job is to help facilitate that closure.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.95,1:22:16.27,中文,,0,0,0,,我该怎么跟她爸爸说\N{\r外文}Then you tell me, what do I tell her father?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.35,1:22:18.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我们逮到了凶手\N{\r外文}We caught the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.51,1:22:19.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我们没法拯救受害者\N{\r外文}We can't save the victims.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.75,1:22:22.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我们不必负责安慰死者家属\N{\r外文}It's not our job to make the relatives feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.35,1:22:27.55,中文,,0,0,0,,曾经拥有的都会失去 你自己也说过\N{\r外文}We lose everything that we care about. Those are your words.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.59,1:22:31.63,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔的死不是你的错\N{\r外文}Doug, it's not your fault that Claire dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.15,1:22:36.15,中文,,0,0,0,,那是一种说法\N{\r外文}Yeah, that's one theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.67,1:22:43.51,中文,,0,0,0,,黛安·凯莉少尉\N{\r外文}Lieutenant Junior Grade Dianne Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.87,1:22:45.67,中文,,0,0,0,,马丁·凯尔\N{\r外文}Martin Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.83,1:22:49.59,中文,,0,0,0,,法兰西莱斯中校\N{\r外文}Commander Francis Lacey, retired.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.07,1:22:51.87,中文,,0,0,0,,伊莲·莱斯\N{\r外文}Elaine Lacey.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.15,1:22:55.71,中文,,0,0,0,,戴伦·麦安德鲁士官长\N{\r外文}Chief Petty Officer Darren McAndrews.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.51,1:22:58.43,中文,,0,0,0,,萝琳·麦安德鲁\N{\r外文}Lorraine McAndrews.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.75,1:23:02.71,中文,,0,0,0,,电机技师莉莎·梅薇\N{\r外文}Electronics Technician Lisa Melville.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.31,1:23:06.15,中文,,0,0,0,,随军牧师本杰明·门德尔松\N{\r外文}Chaplain Rabbi Benjamin Mendelsson.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.19,1:23:49.64,中文,,0,0,0,,（你可以救她）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.27,1:23:56.64,中文,,0,0,0,,（浸信会教堂 拯救世人）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.15,1:24:18.88,中文,,0,0,0,,（来电显示 道格·柯林）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.99,1:24:24.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我是道格\N{\r外文}Denny? It's Doug.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.83,1:24:27.47,中文,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会打来\N{\r外文}Well, I can't say I wasn't expecting this call.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.23,1:24:30.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你知道这么做的结果\N{\r外文}Look, you know what happens if you try this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.91,1:24:32.51,中文,,0,0,0,,你也知道我不这么做的结果\N{\r外文}We both know what happens if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.59,1:24:36.99,中文,,0,0,0,,不是很多人愿意当实验鼠送死\N{\r外文}Well, not a lot of guinea pigs volunteer to die in the name of science.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.07,1:24:40.91,中文,,0,0,0,,那你就得确定我不会死\N{\r外文}Well, then we have to make sure I end up somewhere besides the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.51,1:24:42.91,中文,,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗\N{\r外文}Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.47,1:24:49.75,中文,,0,0,0,,等你到了再说\N{\r外文}I'll see you when you get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.15,1:24:52.27,中文,,0,0,0,,道格吗\N{\r外文}Doug?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.39,1:25:03.39,中文,,0,0,0,,事情做完了 随手关灯 拜托\N{\r外文}Do me a favour. When you finish, turn off the lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.83,1:25:27.31,中文,,0,0,0,,你再刷一次就会触动警铃\N{\r外文}You do that one more time, you set off every alarm in the joint.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.71,1:25:32.87,中文,,0,0,0,,不能带枪\N{\r外文}Can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.95,1:25:34.59,中文,,0,0,0,,质量太重\N{\r外文}Gotta keep the mass as low as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.67,1:25:36.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你也把衣服脱掉\N{\r外文}You gotta take everything off.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.95,1:25:45.51,中文,,0,0,0,,可以穿内衣裤 谢了\N{\r外文}You can keep your underwear on. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.03,1:25:49.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你不是相信不该改变过去吗\N{\r外文}Thought you said you didn't believe in changing the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.19,1:25:52.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我也信上帝\N{\r外文}Right. Well, I also believe in God.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.99,1:25:54.39,中文,,0,0,0,,别告诉别人\N{\r外文}Just don't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.47,1:25:56.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我要告诉大家\N{\r外文}I'm gonna tell everybody. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.71,1:25:59.59,中文,,0,0,0,,当我打开这个开关\N{\r外文}You know, when I open up the throttle on this thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.71,1:26:03.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道 电磁波 心跳停止\N{\r外文}Yeah, I know. EM field, flatline. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.47,1:26:06.27,中文,,0,0,0,,不管我们自以为有多聪明\N{\r外文}Thing of it is, no matter how clever we think we are,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.35,1:26:08.95,中文,,0,0,0,,这次实验结果大概是四天半前\N{\r外文}the most probable outcome of our little experiment
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.03,1:26:12.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你会接到验尸官的电话说\N{\r外文}is that four and a half days ago you get a call from the coroner's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.87,1:26:15.07,中文,,0,0,0,,柯林探员 请你过来\N{\r外文}"Hey, Agent Carlin, I want you to come down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.15,1:26:16.91,中文,,0,0,0,,看一具尸体\N{\r外文}There's something you should see."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.99,1:26:19.99,中文,,0,0,0,,然后你会站在一具尸体前面\N{\r外文}And next thing you know, you're standing over a corpse
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.07,1:26:21.51,中文,,0,0,0,,那具尸体就是你\N{\r外文}and it's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.39,1:26:27.27,中文,,0,0,0,,失败一百万次 总有一次会成功\N{\r外文}Well, you can be wrong a million times. You only gotta be right once.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.35,1:26:29.67,中文,,0,0,0,,真是那样我也会记得的\N{\r外文}Besides, I think I'd remember if that happened, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.75,1:26:31.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我的脸要朝外吗\N{\r外文}So I gotta face out toward you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.87,1:26:34.71,中文,,0,0,0,,对 就像那张纸条\N{\r外文}Yeah, face out. Just like the note, only bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.23,1:26:38.39,中文,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 没有\N{\r外文}You ready? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.71,1:26:42.03,中文,,0,0,0,,你不必这么做\N{\r外文}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.71,1:26:45.55,中文,,0,0,0,,也许我已经做了\N{\r外文}What if I already have?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.35,1:26:47.55,中文,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\r外文}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.83,1:27:01.91,中文,,0,0,0,,道格\N{\r外文}Doug?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.91,1:27:05.23,中文,,0,0,0,,道格\N{\r外文}Doug?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.31,1:27:07.99,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 喂\N{\r外文}Hey. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.11,1:27:10.15,中文,,0,0,0,,你还好吧 还好\N{\r外文}You okay in there? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.23,1:27:12.07,中文,,0,0,0,,没事吧 没事\N{\r外文}You good? Yeah, yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.15,1:27:14.71,中文,,0,0,0,,只是有点分心\N{\r外文}I'm beside myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.43,1:27:19.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我还在吗\N{\r外文}Am I still here?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.39,1:27:20.75,中文,,0,0,0,,还在 好了吗\N{\r外文}For now. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.87,1:27:22.43,中文,,0,0,0,,是 准备好了 好\N{\r外文}Yeah, I'm ready. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.51,1:27:25.55,中文,,0,0,0,,等不及要在四天前跑去吓你\N{\r外文}Looking forward to walking up to you four days ago and blowing your mind, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.63,1:27:28.51,中文,,0,0,0,,告诉我看到四天前的你的感觉\N{\r外文}Well, if that happens, maybe you can tell me what it's like to meet your younger self.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.59,1:27:30.47,中文,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\r外文}All right, I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.59,1:27:35.27,中文,,0,0,0,,嘉年华那天10点50分渡轮爆炸\N{\r外文}All right, remember, the ferry blows at 10:50 on Fat Tuesday, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.15,1:27:37.27,中文,,0,0,0,,是\N{\r外文}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.55,1:27:39.91,中文,,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\r外文}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.99,1:27:42.27,中文,,0,0,0,,昨天见吧\N{\r外文}See you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.39,1:27:43.71,中文,,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\r外文}God willing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.51,1:28:09.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你不必这么做\N{\r外文}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.75,1:28:11.11,中文,,0,0,0,,也许我已经做了 是谁\N{\r外文}You don't have to do this. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.19,1:28:12.31,中文,,0,0,0,,或许我早已办妥\N{\r外文}Maybe I already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.39,1:28:13.91,中文,,0,0,0,,或许我早已办妥\N{\r外文}Maybe I already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.99,1:28:18.95,中文,,0,0,0,,搞什么 别紧张\N{\r外文}What the hell? All right, hold on, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.03,1:28:21.87,中文,,0,0,0,,紧急发电机会启动 谁都别动\N{\r外文}The reserve generators should kick in. Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.95,1:28:23.91,中文,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\r外文}That was interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.35,1:28:28.91,中文,,0,0,0,,医生 他是谁\N{\r外文}Doctor! Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.99,1:28:30.83,中文,,0,0,0,,从哪儿冒出来\N{\r外文}Where'd he come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.31,1:28:35.67,中文,,0,0,0,,把他送到创伤加护病房\N{\r外文}All right, let's get him into Trauma. Trauma 2, Trauma 2!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.68,1:28:40.72,中文,,0,0,0,,（替我急救）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.81,1:28:42.05,中文,,0,0,0,,怪了\N{\r外文}This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.31,1:28:45.87,中文,,0,0,0,,电击 让开\N{\r外文}Defib. Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.35,1:28:48.19,中文,,0,0,0,,再充电\N{\r外文}Recharge it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.95,1:28:50.19,中文,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\r外文}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.59,1:28:52.47,中文,,0,0,0,,充电到300焦耳 充电中\N{\r外文}Recharge to 300. Charging.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.99,1:28:54.19,中文,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\r外文}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.87,1:29:00.35,中文,,0,0,0,,进行心肺复苏术 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\N{\r外文}Resume CPR. One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.23,1:29:30.79,中文,,0,0,0,,机场最低气温是9摄氏度\N{\r外文}Forty-nine was our low temperature at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.87,1:29:34.23,中文,,0,0,0,,今晚的气温差不多是这样 或许会更低些\N{\r外文}Gonna be at that or just maybe above that for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.31,1:29:36.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你原因 看 开始起风了\N{\r外文}Let me show you why. Look, the winds are starting...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.67,1:29:59.59,中文,,0,0,0,,有几个刚撤走的队伍又折返了 我正琢磨着去纹个身\N{\r外文}...a few of them come back. I'm thinking about getting a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.71,1:30:01.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我是联邦探员\N{\r外文}Whoa! I'm a federal agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.07,1:30:04.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我需要车钥匙 还有你的车\N{\r外文}I need your keys. I need a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.51,1:30:06.19,中文,,0,0,0,,救护车上面有钥匙\N{\r外文}There's keys in the truck there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.27,1:30:08.31,中文,,0,0,0,,哪一辆 这辆吗 把手放下来\N{\r外文}Which one? Right here? Put your hands down.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.39,1:30:11.59,中文,,0,0,0,,把手放在桌上 别乱来\N{\r外文}Hands on the table. Hold your doughnut. Hands right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.35,1:30:14.59,中文,,0,0,0,,记得替它浇水\N{\r外文}Water it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.55,1:30:39.47,中文,,0,0,0,,这也许是存在本身的隐喻\N{\r外文}This might be a metaphor for existence itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.55,1:30:45.03,中文,,0,0,0,,一条鱼对抗一个无形的敌人\N{\r外文}A fish struggles instinctively against an almost formless antagonist.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.11,1:30:46.99,中文,,0,0,0,,这条鱼是尖吻鲈\N{\r外文}The fish is a largemouth bass.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.35,1:31:03.59,中文,,0,0,0,,这是八点半新闻\N{\r外文}Here's the news at 8:30.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.67,1:31:06.63,中文,,0,0,0,,政府官员完全不明白\N{\r外文}Federal officials are still baffled by the massive blackout
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.71,1:31:10.59,中文,,0,0,0,,今晨东岸为何发生大停电\N{\r外文}that darkened the entire eastern half of the country early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.59,1:33:06.79,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\r外文}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.71,1:34:30.11,中文,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\r外文}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:39.43,中文,,0,0,0,,等等 别激动\N{\r外文}Wait a minute. Hey, it's okay. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.51,1:34:41.31,中文,,0,0,0,,听着 克莱尔\N{\r外文}Listen. Claire!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.39,1:34:44.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我是联邦探员 冷静点\N{\r外文}I'm a federal agent. Hang on, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.03,1:34:46.75,中文,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\r外文}All right, it's okay. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.83,1:34:49.39,中文,,0,0,0,,我是联邦探员 没事了\N{\r外文}I'm a federal agent. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.51,1:34:52.35,中文,,0,0,0,,你安全了 你没事了\N{\r外文}You're safe. You're all right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.43,1:34:56.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我是联邦探员 你安全了 看着我\N{\r外文}I'm a federal agent. You're safe. You're safe. Look at me. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.83,1:34:59.07,中文,,0,0,0,,你安全了 他走了\N{\r外文}You're safe. He's gone. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.39,1:35:03.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我得出去\N{\r外文}Get me out of here! All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.99,1:35:05.95,中文,,0,0,0,,带我出去\N{\r外文}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.03,1:35:09.63,中文,,0,0,0,,没事了 没关系\N{\r外文}It's all right. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.23,1:35:14.11,中文,,0,0,0,,带我出去 我帮你松绑\N{\r外文}Get me out of here. All right, let me get your feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.19,1:35:16.87,中文,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\r外文}It's all right. It's all right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.63,1:35:22.07,中文,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\r外文}Hey, look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.19,1:35:24.51,中文,,0,0,0,,我要救你出去\N{\r外文}I'm gonna get you out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.59,1:35:26.03,中文,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\r外文}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.67,1:35:43.55,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道车上有钥匙\N{\r外文}How'd you know there'd be keys in this truck?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.63,1:35:46.43,中文,,0,0,0,,问得好 我也不知道\N{\r外文}That's a good question. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.07,1:35:52.19,中文,,0,0,0,,他是恐怖份子 对\N{\r外文}He's a terrorist? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.27,1:35:56.71,中文,,0,0,0,,他叫卡罗尔·厄尔施塔特 我是专案监视小组成员\N{\r外文}His name is Carroll Oerstadt. I'm a part of a special surveillance unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.79,1:35:58.35,中文,,0,0,0,,我们负责跟踪他\N{\r外文}We've been tracking him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.43,1:36:02.75,中文,,0,0,0,,他打算今天10点50分炸掉渡轮\N{\r外文}He's planning on blowing up the Canal Street Ferry today at 10:50.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.11,1:36:08.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我们要去报警 不 事情太复杂\N{\r外文}So we're going to the police? No, it's too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.07,1:36:11.31,中文,,0,0,0,,等我们让他们到那时 来不及了\N{\r外文}By the time we get them up to speed, the ferry will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.39,1:36:13.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我们要直接去码头\N{\r外文}We gotta go straight to the Algiers dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.15,1:36:15.55,中文,,0,0,0,,不行 你失血过多\N{\r外文}I don't think you're gonna make it. You're losing too much blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.63,1:36:19.07,中文,,0,0,0,,一定要 我只有1小时40分\N{\r外文}No, I gotta make it. I only got an hour and 40 minutes to catch up to this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.15,1:36:22.59,中文,,0,0,0,,要是赶不到呢 会发生什么\N{\r外文}What if you don't make it? What happens then?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.67,1:36:24.63,中文,,0,0,0,,要是赶不到\N{\r外文}If I don't make it...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.59,1:36:28.07,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\r外文}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.15,1:36:30.27,中文,,0,0,0,,我顺路\N{\r外文}Your house is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.35,1:36:32.03,中文,,0,0,0,,一会到你家清洗\N{\r外文}We'll go by your house, and I'll get cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.11,1:36:35.91,中文,,0,0,0,,让你回家 好吧\N{\r外文}I'll drop you off. All right? All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.99,1:36:38.55,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 金珍\N{\r外文}Hey, Ginger.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.31,1:36:41.31,中文,,0,0,0,,她讨厌陌生人\N{\r外文}She hates strangers.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.39,1:36:42.55,中文,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\r外文}You need anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.63,1:36:44.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你去洗干净 我自己来\N{\r外文}You get cleaned up. I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.67,1:36:48.03,中文,,0,0,0,,确定 我帮你绑绷带 不用 你去忙吧\N{\r外文}You sure? I could bind that for you. No, I'm sure. You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.11,1:36:50.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我需要借你男友的夹克\N{\r外文}I'm gonna need to borrow one of your boyfriend's jackets, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.87,1:36:51.91,中文,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\r外文}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.81,1:37:04.85,中文,,0,0,0,,（你可以救她）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.23,1:37:41.27,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 听好\N{\r外文}Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.35,1:37:43.95,中文,,0,0,0,,别穿那件衣服 什么\N{\r外文}You shouldn't wear that. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.91,1:37:46.31,中文,,0,0,0,,换另外一套衣服\N{\r外文}Why don't you put on a different one?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.39,1:37:49.51,中文,,0,0,0,,蓝白色的那件\N{\r外文}The blue and white one. Anything. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.59,1:37:50.75,中文,,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\r外文}Just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.83,1:37:54.95,中文,,0,0,0,,死者也穿同样的衣服 很不吉利\N{\r外文}The victim wore a dress like that and it wouldn't be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.51,1:37:58.27,中文,,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\r外文}Okay. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.63,1:38:03.19,中文,,0,0,0,,好 我去换衣服 马上出来\N{\r外文}All right, I'll go change. I'll be right out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.63,1:38:15.51,中文,,0,0,0,,站住 别动\N{\r外文}Stop right there! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.59,1:38:17.83,中文,,0,0,0,,别动 我要报警\N{\r外文}Don't move. I'm calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.91,1:38:19.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我就是警察 你不是\N{\r外文}I am the police. No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.71,1:38:21.07,中文,,0,0,0,,我是 你才不是\N{\r外文}Yes, I am. No, you're not!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.15,1:38:23.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你没有讯问我或做笔录\N{\r外文}You didn't ask me any questions. You didn't take a statement.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.99,1:38:27.31,中文,,0,0,0,,甚至知道我家在哪里 和我有什么衣服\N{\r外文}And you knew where my house was, what's in my closet.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.63,1:38:31.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你是谁 我是道格·柯林 ATF探员\N{\r外文}Who are you? I'm Doug Carlin. I'm an ATF agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.71,1:38:34.39,中文,,0,0,0,,负责监视企图杀你的那个人\N{\r外文}I'm part of a special surveillance unit that's been tracking the man who was trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.40,1:38:36.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道这是真的\N{\r外文}How do I know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.31,1:38:37.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我的头被罩住 也许你就是他\N{\r外文}I had a hood over my head. You could be him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.95,1:38:39.07,中文,,0,0,0,,你想想 克莱尔\N{\r外文}Just think about it, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.15,1:38:40.87,中文,,0,0,0,,看吧 你抓伤了他的脸\N{\r外文}Look at my face. You scratched the man's face.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.95,1:38:42.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我脸上有抓痕吗\N{\r外文}Do I have a scratch on my face?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.79,1:38:46.63,中文,,0,0,0,,你不是抓伤了他的脸吗 趴在地上\N{\r外文}You scratched him, didn't you? Get on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.71,1:38:49.35,中文,,0,0,0,,快点 趴在地上\N{\r外文}Now! Get on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.59,1:38:54.23,中文,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\r外文}All the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.31,1:38:59.47,中文,,0,0,0,,烟酒枪械管制局唐纳利探员\N{\r外文}ATF New Orleans, Agent Donnelly.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.55,1:39:03.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你的单位有道格·柯林探员吗\N{\r外文}Yes, is there an Agent Douglas Carlin working out of that branch?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.79,1:39:06.27,中文,,0,0,0,,有 可是他不在\N{\r外文}Yes, there is, but he's not here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.71,1:39:08.43,中文,,0,0,0,,你要留言吗\N{\r外文}Would you like to leave a message?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.51,1:39:10.55,中文,,0,0,0,,形容他的长相\N{\r外文}Can you describe him for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.63,1:39:12.47,中文,,0,0,0,,身高和肤色\N{\r外文}How tall, skin colour.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.23,1:39:18.15,中文,,0,0,0,,他身高大约一米九 黑人 挺帅的\N{\r外文}I don't know. He's 6'3", black, not bad-looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.99,1:39:23.59,中文,,0,0,0,,请他打给我\N{\r外文}Okay, have him call me back
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.67,1:39:27.15,中文,,0,0,0,,电话877 504 8423\N{\r外文}at 877-504-8423.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.23,1:39:28.87,中文,,0,0,0,,便签纸没了\N{\r外文}Okay, wait. My phone pad's empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.95,1:39:30.27,中文,,0,0,0,,抄好了\N{\r外文}All right, got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.87,1:39:32.95,中文,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\r外文}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.11,1:39:39.31,中文,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\r外文}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.67,1:39:48.95,中文,,0,0,0,,请你告诉我真相\N{\r外文}Are you gonna tell me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.03,1:39:53.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你为什么在这里 发生什么事 这一切都没道理\N{\r外文}Are you gonna tell me why you're here, why this is happening and none of it makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.77,1:39:54.91,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\r外文}None of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.55,1:39:59.43,中文,,0,0,0,,如果你有一件非得说出口的事实\N{\r外文}What if you had to tell someone the most important thing in the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.55,1:40:01.75,中文,,0,0,0,,但你知道没人相信你\N{\r外文}but you knew they'd never believe you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.59,1:40:04.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你会怎么做\N{\r外文}What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.91,1:40:07.03,中文,,0,0,0,,我会继续尝试\N{\r外文}I'd try.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.07,1:40:10.91,中文,,0,0,0,,也许有人会相信\N{\r外文}You never know what someone might believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.03,1:40:21.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我不知道发生什么事\N{\r外文}I don't understand what's... What's happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.07,1:40:47.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我必须赶去码头\N{\r外文}I gotta hurry up and get down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.03,1:40:50.75,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么只有你能阻止他\N{\r外文}Why are you the only one who can stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.83,1:40:52.75,中文,,0,0,0,,只有我知道他的计划\N{\r外文}Well, because I'm the only one that knows his plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.83,1:40:54.59,中文,,0,0,0,,也知道他在哪里\N{\r外文}I'm the only one that knows where he's gonna be
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.67,1:40:56.35,中文,,0,0,0,,会做什么\N{\r外文}and exactly what he's gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.43,1:40:57.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\r外文}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.07,1:41:00.63,中文,,0,0,0,,这么多关于我的事\N{\r外文}I mean, how'd you know those things about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.95,1:41:02.75,中文,,0,0,0,,政府发明一种特别的机器\N{\r外文}Well, for the sake of argument,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.83,1:41:05.35,中文,,0,0,0,,让我事先知道\N{\r外文}let's just say that the government has a special device
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.43,1:41:09.31,中文,,0,0,0,,会发生什么事\N{\r外文}that allows me to know what's gonna happen ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.79,1:41:12.15,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么不知道我会用枪指着你\N{\r外文}Then how come you didn't know I was gonna pull a gun on you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.23,1:41:14.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道 不 我不知道\N{\r外文}I did. No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.43,1:41:20.67,中文,,0,0,0,,还好吧 很好\N{\r外文}Is that okay? Yeah, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.99,1:41:23.31,中文,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\r外文}One second.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.15,1:41:32.55,中文,,0,0,0,,应该不会松掉 可以吗 很好\N{\r外文}I think that's gonna stay. Is that okay? Yeah, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.63,1:41:33.67,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.55,1:41:39.27,中文,,0,0,0,,我不是很在行 你做得很好\N{\r外文}All right. I'm not very good at this. You're very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.83,1:41:54.55,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\r外文}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.55,1:41:56.91,中文,,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\r外文}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.43,1:42:02.47,中文,,0,0,0,,我什么也没改变\N{\r外文}I haven't changed a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.63,1:42:05.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我得走了 你得跟来\N{\r外文}I gotta go. And you gotta go with me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.03,1:42:07.23,中文,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\r外文}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.71,1:42:10.23,中文,,0,0,0,,你说我很安全 我错了\N{\r外文}I thought you said I was safe now. I was wrong. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.31,1:42:11.99,中文,,0,0,0,,你得马上跟我来\N{\r外文}You gotta go with me now. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.27,1:42:15.43,中文,,0,0,0,,等等 不要接\N{\r外文}Wait, wait, wait! Don't answer it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.59,1:42:19.03,中文,,0,0,0,,不要接 我证明给你看\N{\r外文}Don't answer it. I'll prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.11,1:42:20.27,中文,,0,0,0,,那是你朋友贝丝打来的\N{\r外文}That's your friend Beth calling.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.35,1:42:21.83,中文,,0,0,0,,让答录机接听 她会说\N{\r外文}Let the machine pick it up, she's gonna say,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.91,1:42:25.51,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我是贝丝 你在吗 抱歉这么早给你打电话\N{\r外文}"Hi, Claire. It's Beth. Are you there? I'm sorry to call you so early,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.59,1:42:28.59,中文,,0,0,0,,你说回到家会打给我 你没有打来害我很担心\N{\r外文}but when you didn't call me last night I got worried."
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.11,1:42:31.95,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我是贝丝 你在吗\N{\r外文}Claire? Hi, it's Beth. Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.03,1:42:33.43,中文,,0,0,0,,抱歉这么早给你打电话\N{\r外文}I'm sorry to call you so early,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.51,1:42:35.55,中文,,0,0,0,,你说回到家会打给我\N{\r外文}but you said you were gonna call me when you got home,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.63,1:42:37.43,中文,,0,0,0,,你没有打来害我很担心\N{\r外文}and when you didn't, I started to get worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.51,1:42:39.19,中文,,0,0,0,,贝丝 你在耍我吗 没有\N{\r外文}Beth, is this a joke? Oh, hey, hey! No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.27,1:42:41.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我只是替你担心\N{\r外文}Like I said, I was just worried about you, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.19,1:42:43.19,中文,,0,0,0,,有人在 我不方便讲话 稍后打给你\N{\r外文}I can't talk right now. Someone's here. I'll call you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.27,1:42:44.39,中文,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\r外文}Claire...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.47,1:42:47.63,中文,,0,0,0,,相信我 你跟着我才安全\N{\r外文}Believe me, the only one you're gonna be safe with is me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.71,1:42:49.31,中文,,0,0,0,,好 走吧\N{\r外文}Okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.51,1:42:55.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\r外文}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.75,1:42:59.35,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么不报警叫他们在码头抓他\N{\r外文}Why not just call the police and have them arrest him at the dock?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.87,1:43:02.27,中文,,0,0,0,,他会在那里引爆炸弹\N{\r外文}He'll set the bomb off right there on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.35,1:43:03.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我要让他措手不及\N{\r外文}He can't know he's been compromised
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.95,1:43:05.99,中文,,0,0,0,,来不及行动\N{\r外文}until it's too late for him to do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.11,1:43:08.83,中文,,0,0,0,,不然他就会设好定时器\N{\r外文}He'll set the timer, walk away on foot, get on his motorcycle
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.91,1:43:11.79,中文,,0,0,0,,骑机车到桥上等着看\N{\r外文}and ride to the Crescent City Bridge to watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.87,1:43:15.51,中文,,0,0,0,,然后呢 你要拆解炸弹\N{\r外文}Okay, then what? You defuse the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.99,1:43:17.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我要拆解炸弹\N{\r外文}Then I defuse the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.31,1:44:18.19,中文,,0,0,0,,那是我的车\N{\r外文}There's my truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.79,1:44:29.75,中文,,0,0,0,,好多人 他在那里\N{\r外文}All these people. There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.83,1:44:31.19,中文,,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\r外文}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.27,1:44:34.31,中文,,0,0,0,,穿军事夹克 朝这儿走\N{\r外文}You see the military jacket coming this way?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.31,1:44:40.19,中文,,0,0,0,,跟你说的一样\N{\r外文}It's just what you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.27,1:44:43.51,中文,,0,0,0,,看到后面的警察吗\N{\r外文}All right, you see those officers behind you?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.59,1:44:45.71,中文,,0,0,0,,渡轮走了\N{\r外文}Yeah. When the ferry pulls off,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.83,1:44:48.31,中文,,0,0,0,,就告诉他们炸弹的事\N{\r外文}I want you to tell them about the bomb, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.39,1:44:50.79,中文,,0,0,0,,他们会相信我吗 最好会\N{\r外文}They'll believe me? They better believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.87,1:44:53.11,中文,,0,0,0,,他们会逮捕我 他们不会\N{\r外文}Come on, they'll arrest me. They won't arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.19,1:44:56.83,中文,,0,0,0,,他们会拘留你 你没事的 那是好事\N{\r外文}They'll take you into custody. You'll be fine. That's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.19,1:44:58.59,中文,,0,0,0,,别转头\N{\r外文}Don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.15,1:45:06.43,中文,,0,0,0,,道格\N{\r外文}Doug...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.43,1:45:10.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你要小心\N{\r外文}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.79,1:45:45.67,中文,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\r外文}Your attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.75,1:45:48.35,中文,,0,0,0,,启航后乘客不准在\N{\r外文}Passengers are not allowed on the car deck
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.43,1:45:50.99,中文,,0,0,0,,停车甲板逗留\N{\r外文}when the ferry is in motion.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.63,1:45:59.23,中文,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\r外文}Sir! Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.31,1:46:01.87,中文,,0,0,0,,请你到上面\N{\r外文}Excuse me, sir, you're gonna have to move to the upper deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.99,1:46:04.55,中文,,0,0,0,,乘客不准来这里\N{\r外文}Passengers aren't allowed here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.99,1:46:46.23,中文,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 他们竟然准时\N{\r外文}Can't believe it. They're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.31,1:46:48.59,中文,,0,0,0,,带这些水手去狂欢吧\N{\r外文}Let's get these boys to their party.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.27,1:47:13.15,中文,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\r外文}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.59,1:48:57.83,中文,,0,0,0,,对不起 先生\N{\r外文}Excuse me, sir? Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.91,1:49:01.23,中文,,0,0,0,,乘客不准在停车甲板逗留\N{\r外文}There's no passengers allowed on the car deck during transit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.55,1:49:06.79,中文,,0,0,0,,乘客不准来这里\N{\r外文}No passengers allowed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.23,1:49:22.39,中文,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\r外文}Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.11,1:50:21.87,中文,,0,0,0,,这是使命 厄尔施塔特\N{\r外文}It's destiny, Oerstadt.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.71,1:50:25.91,中文,,0,0,0,,撒旦像人类 上帝才是永恒\N{\r外文}Satan reasons like a man, but God thinks of eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.63,1:50:30.15,中文,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\r外文}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.23,1:50:33.87,中文,,0,0,0,,上帝派我来阻止你\N{\r外文}I'm saying it's gonna take a little divine intervention here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.83,1:50:37.47,中文,,0,0,0,,我要出来了\N{\r外文}I'm coming out.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.59,1:50:47.23,中文,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\r外文}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.31,1:50:50.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我以为你是爱国者\N{\r外文}I thought you were a patriot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.39,1:50:51.59,中文,,0,0,0,,我是\N{\r外文}Oh, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.75,1:50:54.99,中文,,0,0,0,,为了爱国必须牺牲\N{\r外文}Patriotism requires sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.55,1:50:58.91,中文,,0,0,0,,我愿意牺牲 牺牲谁 她 我\N{\r外文}I'm willing to sacrifice. Yeah? Who? Her? Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.99,1:51:01.55,中文,,0,0,0,,你只牺牲别人 不是自己\N{\r外文}You're willing to sacrifice others, but not yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.63,1:51:05.99,中文,,0,0,0,,自由之树必须用 爱国者和暴君的血来灌溉\N{\r外文}The Tree of Liberty must be refreshed with the blood of patriots and tyrants.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.15,1:51:08.31,中文,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\r外文}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.39,1:51:12.11,中文,,0,0,0,,有时候为了自由必须牺牲人命\N{\r外文}Sometimes a little human collateral is the cost of freedom, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.11,1:51:19.11,中文,,0,0,0,,厄尔施塔特 你是什么人\N{\r外文}Who are you, Oerstadt?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.03,1:51:23.47,中文,,0,0,0,,你到底是什么人\N{\r外文}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.23,1:51:28.31,中文,,0,0,0,,事情不应该是这样\N{\r外文}It's not supposed to be this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.15,1:51:57.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\r外文}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.95,1:52:03.95,中文,,0,0,0,,我把他撞死了 不 是我射杀了他\N{\r外文}I killed him. No, you didn't. I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.03,1:52:06.91,中文,,0,0,0,,今天是肥美周二 10点48分 新奥尔良嘉年华会\N{\r外文}It's 10:48 on Fat Tuesday, Mardi Gras.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.99,1:52:09.63,中文,,0,0,0,,我把时间倒转到1964年\N{\r外文}Now let's go back in time to 1964.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.71,1:52:11.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我们都会死 不会\N{\r外文}We're gonna die. No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.87,1:52:14.39,中文,,0,0,0,,这里是FM 105.3频道 新奥尔良的心灵之声\N{\r外文}...on 105.3 FM, the heart of New Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.47,1:52:16.35,中文,,0,0,0,,快踩油门\N{\r外文}Hit the gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.43,1:52:17.95,中文,,0,0,0,,踩油门\N{\r外文}Hit the gas!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.59,1:52:27.23,中文,,0,0,0,,把手举起来 马上下车\N{\r外文}Put your hands in the air and step out of the vehicle now!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.91,1:52:31.31,中文,,0,0,0,,我们一下车 大家都会死\N{\r外文}We get out now, everybody dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.79,1:52:34.99,中文,,0,0,0,,我要数到三\N{\r外文}You have until the count of three!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.07,1:52:36.19,中文,,0,0,0,,踩油门吧\N{\r外文}Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.27,1:52:37.31,中文,,0,0,0,,一\N{\r外文}One...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.91,1:54:54.11,中文,,0,0,0,,我女儿在渡轮上面 拜托\N{\r外文}But my daughter's on that ferry. Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.59,1:54:56.79,中文,,0,0,0,,天啊 我的女儿\N{\r外文}Oh, God, my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.27,1:55:12.79,中文,,0,0,0,,克莉丝\N{\r外文}Chrissie!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.43,1:55:14.67,中文,,0,0,0,,克莉丝\N{\r外文}Chrissie!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.75,1:55:17.15,中文,,0,0,0,,克莉丝 是妈妈\N{\r外文}Oh, Chrissie! Chrissie! It's my mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.23,1:55:18.31,中文,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\r外文}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.35,1:55:27.67,中文,,0,0,0,,小姐 请你留在这里\N{\r外文}Ma'am? We're gonna need you to stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.75,1:55:32.31,中文,,0,0,0,,有人会过来替你做笔录\N{\r外文}Someone's on the way over to take a statement and ask you some questions, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.19,1:55:59.55,中文,,0,0,0,,巴比 道格\N{\r外文}Bobby. Doug.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.63,1:56:01.03,中文,,0,0,0,,你好吗 很好\N{\r外文}How you doing? All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.11,1:56:03.63,中文,,0,0,0,,从水中救了一个人\N{\r外文}Got a live one over here. Pulled her out of the drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.71,1:56:06.03,中文,,0,0,0,,和这件事有关联\N{\r外文}Somehow involved in all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.83,1:56:10.95,中文,,0,0,0,,好\N{\r外文}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.71,1:56:19.55,中文,,0,0,0,,你还好吧 道格\N{\r外文}How you doing? Doug?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.59,1:56:22.07,中文,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\r外文}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.39,1:56:27.39,中文,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 没事\N{\r外文}You okay? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.19,1:56:33.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我们见过吗\N{\r外文}Have we met?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.43,1:56:38.23,中文,,0,0,0,,有 我们见过\N{\r外文}Yeah. Yeah, we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.07,1:56:43.75,中文,,0,0,0,,没事了 走吧\N{\r外文}It's okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.67,1:56:45.91,中文,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\r外文}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.95,1:57:02.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 没事\N{\r外文}You okay? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.91,1:57:04.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你确定 是\N{\r外文}You sure? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.83,1:57:07.55,中文,,0,0,0,,我会让你暖和起来\N{\r外文}Okay. I'll get you warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.43,1:57:18.83,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\r外文}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.39,1:57:20.51,中文,,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\r外文}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.59,1:57:21.95,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\r外文}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.11,1:57:28.23,中文,,0,0,0,,道格\N{\r外文}Doug.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.35,1:57:34.07,中文,,0,0,0,,如果你有一件非得说出口的事实\N{\r外文}What if you had to tell someone the most important thing in the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.15,1:57:36.83,中文,,0,0,0,,但你知道没人相信你\N{\r外文}but you knew they'd never believe you?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.19,1:57:39.43,中文,,0,0,0,,我会继续尝试\N{\r外文}I'd try.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.15,1:57:50.31,中文,,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\r外文}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.99,1:58:13.87,中文,,0,0,0,,（此片向坚强的新奥尔良市民致敬）